<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Ndamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">FIGOLI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Figoli fya Vandundami</para>
  <para style="toc2">Figoli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fgl</para>
  <para style="mt1">FIGOLI</para>
  <para style="mt2">FYA VANDUNDAMI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULELU</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Figoli ndi himusi sha ndambu ya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu wuvakandili pamlima na kupwililikila Yelusalemu mbaka Yudeya na Samaliya na milima yingi ngimu wula Yesu wavawombilili vandundami vaki chipindi akali hela kutoliwa kumbindi kwa Chapanga Figoli sula ya 1:8.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu achi chavelili chiyandikiwa na Lukasi wuwula mweni ayandikili chimu gati ya fitabu fya Chilongu cha Nyanyi. Mweni aveli mganga na aveli mkombikeshi kuyandika filongu fyonda kwa chiganu ngimu wuyifumbukili. Mweni ayandikili chitabu achi cha figoli na chila chitabu cha Chilongu cha Nyanyi fyosi afiyandikili kwa Teufili yaveli Mgiliki lakini fitabu afi wuwowu fyayilatili fikasomiwi na vandu vonda Vagiliki na Vayawudi yivamjumilili Kilistu sula ya 1:1.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pamongapa chitabu cha Figoli chiyandikiwa gati ya myaka milongu sita mbaka milongu sita na mchechi kupita kukandila Kilistu pawonikili. Kwanongwa chitabu chikupelela chipindi Pauli akali kulekishiwa muchijaka. Wuwula Lukasi aveli mumwanja pamu na ndundami Pauli na mweni pamongapa ayandikili Figoli mumbwani ya Antiyokia. Figoli ndi kuyendilela kwa chilongu cha nyanyi chiyandikiwili na Lukasi na chikukandila Yesu payenda kumbindi. Natilu ya Lukasi kuyandika chitabu achi yaveli ngimu yiyila yila payandikili chitabu cha Chilongu cha Nyanyi. Adayilili Teofili pamu na vandu yivayongishikili mukumjumila Kilistu vavi na unakaka mu fila fivawuliwili, topi ayandikili kwa chiganu findu fyosi yififumbukili mu ngalilu ya Yesu na kukwila kwa ujumilwa wa kumjumila Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu achi cha Figoli chikutugayila chilangushilu cha lipinga lya kwaa lya yivamjumilili Kilistu na ndambu wuvayikalili mungalilu ya kumjumila Kilistu. Chilangushilu cha Vandundami chikutulangusha yufwi ndambu ya kwidumba muliwovi lya Mfuki Mng'alili mukukwisha unjagila wa Chilongu cha Nyanyi kwa vengi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fivelili amu kwa chikata,</para>
  <para style="io">Kwaa Mfuki Mng'alili akuvasunukila vandundami na lipinga lya yivajumilili likukanda kukwila sula ya 1:1-8:1.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambeli vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu vakugobuliwa na kukanda kukwila milima yingi panji ya Yelusalemu sula ya 8:2-12:23.</para>
  <para style="io">Kandi Pauli akuyenda mwanja waki wa kwaa wa umishoni sula ya 12:24-14:28.</para>
  <para style="io">Wuwula filongosi vakutang'ana pamu aku Yelusalemu kulamula yichidayiliwa kwa yivajumilili shonu sula ya 15:1-35.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambeli Pauli ayendili mwanja wa pili wa umishoni sula ya 15:36-18:22.</para>
  <para style="io">Kandi ayendili mumwanja wa tatu wa Chilongu cha Nyanyi sula ya 18:23-20:38.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambeli Pauli akamulilwi mu Yelusalemu sula ya 21-26.</para>
  <para style="io">Mbelu Pauli akuyeghiwa Loma sula ya 27-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mkomi Teofili, muchitabu cha kwaa ndayandikili milandu yosi Yesu yagolili na kuwula kukandila pakwandi ya chichuku chaki, <verse number="2" style="v"/>mbaka lijuva lila patoliwili kumbindi. Paghaveyi akali kutoliwa kumbindi Mfuki Mng'alili amgolili avawulili vandundami yivashawulili ndambu ya kuyikala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Majuva milongu mchechi kufumila kusova kwa mweni avafumbukilili myanja yitangalili nakaka aveli mnofu. Vamuwonili, mweni aywangili nawu milandu ya wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Chipindi patang'anikeyi pamu na veni avawulili naha, “Mkotoo kuwuka Yelusalemu, mveteli tanila Mfuki Mng'alili ayu ndi fupu yajangili Tati, mwambikanishili kala pandimuhimulileyi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yohani Mbatisha abatishili kwa machi, pavapita majuva madokwa yumwi damubatishwi kwa Mfuki Mng'alili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akutoliwa kumbindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Topi, vandundami pavatang'anikili pamu na Yesu, vamudashili, “Wuli Bambu, chipindi achi dauvapi kandi wutwa wula vandu va Isilaeli?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kavawombela, “Chipindi na majila va milandu ayi yiva muuwesu wa Tati wangu, ayi milandu yenu ha kumanya kucha dayivi ndili. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini chipindi Mfuki Mng'alili pavavasunukilili yumwi, damupokeli liwovi damuvi vatovilela vangu mumbwani ya Yelusalemu na mumkowa wa Yudeya na Samaliya pamu na mumlima wosi.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Padetili kala afi, kunu pavamlola, atoliwili kumbindi, lifundi limfifa vakotoo kumuwona kandi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pavaveghi vakali vakalola kumbindi, paghaveyi akuyenda, tepu vandu vavili yivavelili vafwala yingwa sha mbuleteee vawolukili pabehi na veni. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vadeta, “Yumwi vandu va Galilaya! Wuli mukuwoloka kunu patoliwa kumbindi? Yesu ayu yatoliwili kufuma kwa yumwi na kuyenda kumbindi, dayisi kandi ndambu yiyeyi yimumuwonili patoliwa kumbindi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Matia akushawuliwa akoli fwasi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pambeli vandundami vawuya Yelusalemu kufuma chidunda chivachikemili Miseyituni chaveli pabehi kucha kilumita yimu kufuma kumbwani. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pavafikili kumbwani vayingilili chumbagati cha mugolofa veni vavelili vakwikala, aveli Petili na Yohani na Yakobi na Andeleya na Filipu na Tomasi na Batulumeyu na Mateyi na Yakobi mwana wa Alufayu na Simoni mlevangila mlima wa Vaisilaeli na Yuda mwana wa Yakobi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Voseva vayikungula pavadadava pamu na vadadala vamonga na Maliya mawaki Yesu pamu na vafwata mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mumajuva vala, Petili awolukili pagati ya vala valongu yivajumilili vayikungili, vosi vaveli vandu mya na milongu mivili, <verse number="16" style="v"/>kadeta, “Valongu vangu yimujumilili, yaveli nakaka lula lubali lwa Mayandiku Vang'alili luvi, lubali lwa Mfuki Mng'alili, kwa filongu fya Dawudi, atungili milandu ya Yudasi, yula yavalongushili vala vandu kumkamula Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yuda aveli yumu wa chipinga chetu, kwanongwa ashawuliwili ghavi mungimbaniku yetu.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mweni ahemilili chitava kwa sila mbiya shapatili kwa chindu chaki cha wafu, kawa pasi luu! Kabaluka, mitima yaki yisekimuka. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kila mundu Muyelusalemu apikanishili milandu yila kwa luga yawu na vachikema chila chitava “Hakeli Dama.” Mana yaki, “Chitava cha Mwasi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Topi, vayandika muchitabu cha Lumbombu:</para>
  <para style="q">‘Makalu vaki vasighala domu,</para>
  <para style="q">mundu yoyosi akotoo kuyikala mugati yaki.’</para>
  <para style="m">Na yiyandikiwa:</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mundu wingi atoli fwasi yaki ya ngimbanikilu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Pambeli, mundu yumu wa vala yivaveli pamu na yufwi chipindi chosi Bambu Yesu paghaveyi mumwanja, ashawuliwi ghavi pamu na yufwi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ayu ghavi yumu wa vala yivayilongushili na yufwi tangila Yohani Mbatisha pabatishagha mbaka lijuva lila Yesu patoliwili kumbindi kufuma kwa yufwi. Ayu daghavi pamu na yufwi muutovileli wa kushukuka kwa Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Apa, vatambula matawa va vandu vavili, wa kwaa Yosefu vamkemaya Balisaba awu Yustu na yumonga Matia. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pambeli vadadava: “Bambu, yuwi kumanya ndima sha vandu vosi. Topi, wutulangushili gati ya ava vavili yoti yumushawulili, <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ili atoli achi chichuku cha undundami yachilekili Yudasi yayendili kwakumanyili Chapanga.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vagola doo, yamponikilili Matia, mweni kayongeshwa kwa vala vandundami vamonga lilongu na yumu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mfuki Mng'alili akusunuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva lya Pendikosti palifikili, vosi vaveli vayikungula pamu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tepu, vapikanisha lishu kufuma kumbindi, lyaveli kucha liyegha likomi, limema munyumba yonda yivayikalili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pambeli, fifumbuka findu kucha myengi ya motu, yiivavili kutula kwa vandu vosi yivavelili mula. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vosi vamemishiwa Mfuki Mng'alili, vakanda kudeta detelu yingi kucha Mfuki Mng'alili wavagolili vadeti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Aku Yelusalemu vavelili Vayawudi, vandu yivamjumili Chapanga, vafumili kila mlima. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pavapikanishili lishu ali, lipinga likomi lya vandu liyikungasha. Vosi valilimuka nendu, pala kila mundu vavapikanishili pavadeta kila mundu cha kayaki mweni. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vajingwa na kuyikang'anika pavayiwombela, “Voseva venikaya va Galilaya yina ndaa? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ponopa yikuva wuliwuli yufwi tukuvapikana kila mundu mukabila yetu? Yiva wuliwuli, vandu vosi tukuvapikana pavadeta kwa kabila shetu? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vamonga gati ya yufwi, Vapalisi na Vamedi na Vaelamu na vamonga venikaya va Mesopotamia na Yudeya na Pondu na mkowa wa Asia, <verse number="10" style="v"/>na Fulugia na Pamfilia na Misili pamu na mwambu wa Libiya pabehi ya Kileni pamu na vahenja vamonga kufuma Loma, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vayawudi na vandu yivalowokili mudini ya Vayawudi, vamonga va Kileti na Vahalabu. Twavosi yufwi tukuvapikana pavadeta kwa kabila shetu milandu mikomi ya Chapanga.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vosi vayikanganika na kujuluvala kunu pavayidasha, “Ayi yiva na mana liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini vamonga vakavadanileyi pavadeta, “Vandu ava valovela difwayi!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandula kwa Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Petili awolukili pamu na vala lilongu na yumu, akandili kuvalandulila vandu kwa lishu likomi: “Valongu va Vayawudi na vosi yimwikala Yelusalemu, mupikanishi kwa finofu filongu fyangu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vandu ava valovela ng'odu ngimu yimuyihola, mbona yiva malavila saa ndatu hela? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nakaka milandu ayi yawombili Yoweli mbuyi wa Chapanga:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>‘Majuva vala va mwishu, Chapanga akudeta,</para>
  <para style="q">dandivamwayili Mfuki wangu vandu vosi.</para>
  <para style="q">Vasongolu na vahinja venu davatungi milandu yangu,</para>
  <para style="q">vafijana venu davaluluti umbuyi wa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q">vavaha venu davaloti milotu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hata kwa vandumindumi vangu valumi na vadala,</para>
  <para style="q">danivamwayili Mfuki wangu majuva vala,</para>
  <para style="q">na veni davatungi milandu yangu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Dagoli filangushilu kumbindi,</para>
  <para style="q">na pasi pamlima danangushi filoja,</para>
  <para style="q">dakuvi na mwasi na motu na lyosi tii, <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lijuva dalighalambuki lwisa,</para>
  <para style="q">na mwesi dawubyuali kucha mwasi,</para>
  <para style="q">paliveyi likali hela kufika lijuva lila likomi lya kwisa Bambu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Apa, mundu yaluva kwa litawa lya Bambu dalowuliwi.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Vayisilaeli, mpikanishi filongu afi! Yesu wa Nasaleti aveli mundu yalangushiwili kwa yufwi na Chapanga kwa mihilu na nangushilu, ya kuyikang'anika na ndambu Chapanga wavalangushili gati yenu kwa kupitila mweni, kucha wula wumumanyili. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yaveli milandu ya Chapanga mweni, yayilatili kala, Yesu atayiwi mumawoku venu, mumuwulaghi kwa kuvalekela vandu va wafu vamuvangilili mulupingika. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lakini Chapanga amshukushili munjifwa, kamlekesha kugoboliwa munjifwa kwanongwa akotoo kuwopiwa na njifwa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Dawudi awombili milandu yimwilatili mundu yula:</para>
  <para style="q">‘Ndamuwonili Bambu pawulongolu yangu chipindi chosi,</para>
  <para style="q">kava na nenga mwambu wangu wa mlilu dandikanyiki ha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ndima yangu yikusekilela,</para>
  <para style="q">kandi lulimi lulumbilila kwa cheleli,</para>
  <para style="q">na njimba yangu dayiikali yikushuvilila,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>nongwa yuwi Chapanga dawuneki ng'odu nenga kumambi,</para>
  <para style="q">wala kumlekishela mng'alili waku awoli.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kunangusha deha sha unofu,</para>
  <para style="q">yuwi dawumemeshi nenga cheleli pawuva pabehi na nenga.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Valongu vangu, ngudayila kuvawombela finofu milandu yimupatili mbuyi wetu mkomi Dawudi. Mweni asovili, vamsika na sembi yaki yiva pakaya yetu mbaka nalelu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Dawudi aveli mbuyi wa Chapanga, yamanyili kucha Chapanga kamwilapila kucha yumu kufuma mulukolu lwaki dahali wutwa waki. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Dawudi awonili kala milandu dagoli Chapanga kavawombela kushukuka kwa Kilistu Mkombola chipindi padetili: Vamleka ng'odu kumambi na mvili waki uwola ng'odu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Chapanga amshukushili Yesu ayu munjifwa na yufwi twavosi ndi vatovilela va unakaka awu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mweni pakweshiwili kala na kuvikiwa mwambu wa mlilu, Chapanga katugayila Mfuki Mng'alili ndi ujangi wa Tati, ponopa Yesu katuyitila kala ayu Mfuki Mng'alili. Achi chimuchiwona na kupikana ponopa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mana Dawudi mweni, akwelili kumbindi ha, ila mweni adetili: ‘Bambu amuwombilili Bambu wangu: Uyikali mwambu wangu wa mlilu, <verse number="35" style="v"/>mbaka ndivagoli vachimdwama vaku vavi kucha chigoda cha kuvikila mawulu vaku.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Vandu vosi va Isilaeli nakaka vakudayiliwa vamanyi kucha ayu Yesu yivamuvangililili mulupingika, Chapanga amugolili Bambu na Kilistu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vandu pavapikanishili afi, fyavasomili mundima, vavadashili Petili na vala vandundami: “Valongu tugoli wuli wuli?” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Petili kayangula, “Mupomeli sambi shenu na mubatishiwi kwa litawa lya Yesu Kilistu ili kila mundu awushiwi sambi na mupokeli Mfuki Mng'alili ndi fupu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nongwa, ujangi waveli wa yumwi na vana venu, kwa vala vosi yivayikala kutali na kila mundu dakemiwi na Bambu wetu Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Avawombilili filongu fitangalili na kuvadedeka vandu pavawombela, “Mulowoki muchileli achi cha wafu.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vajumilili filongu fyaki, vabatishiwa. Lijuva lila vayongishekili vandu alufu ndatu mulipinga lila. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ava vosi vayiwulili kwa vandundami na tuwilumba pamu muulongu, kulya pamu na kudadava.</para>
  <para style="s">Ngalilu ya yivamjumila Kilistu Mkombola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mihilu na miwujawuja fitangalili fyagolikili na vandundami mbaka kila mundu awonili lyova. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Vala vajumilili vosi vaveli vayendilela kuva mahali pamu na findu fyawu fyaveli fya vosi. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Vahemishili fitava na findu fyawu, pambeli vavaghanili mbiya kila mundu ndambu ya shida yaki. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Majuva vosi vatanganikaya munyumba sha Chapanga. Lakini chipindi cha kulya, vatanganikaya munyumba shawu na valili filivi fyawu kwa cheleli na kushisha ndima. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Vamujumili Chapanga, vatamiwili na vandu vosi. Kila lijuva Bambu avayongishili mulipinga lyawu vandu yivavelili vakulowuliwa.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Petili na Yohani vakumlowola chikwavakwava</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva limu, saa tisa pamusi, Petili na Yohani vaveli vakuyenda kunyumba ya Chapanga, chipindi cha kudadava. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwaveli na mundu yaveli chikwavakwava kufumila kuwoneka. Topi vandu vaveli vakumpapa majuva vosi mbaka pamulyangu wa nyumba ya Chapanga wuvawukema, “Mlyangu wa Nyanyi” ili avaluvi vala yivayingila munyumba ya Chapanga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pavawonili Petili na Yohani pavayingila munyumba ya Chapanga, mweni avaluvili vamupi chindu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Petili kamulola ngimu wamulolili Yohani pambeli Petili kamuwombela “Tuloli!” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mweni kavaghalambukila pashuvilila kupata chindu kwa veni. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pambeli Petili kamuwombela, “Nahela mbiya wala chumang'andu, lakini chila chimelili nachu dangugayili. Kwa litawa lya Yesu Kilistu wa Nasaleti, woloki yendiyendi!” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pambeli, kamukamula liwoku lya mlilu, pamtanga kumtandamula bahala pala mawulu na matendi vaki vaveli na liwovi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kajumba, kawoloka kwa mawulu vaki kakanda kuyenda yenda. Pambeli kayingila munyumba ya Chapanga, pamu na veni payendayenda na kujumbanga kunu pamjuma Chapanga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vaveli pala pavamuwonili payendayenda na kumjuma Chapanga, <verse number="10" style="v"/>vandu vamumanyili kucha yula ndi yayikalagha na kuluva pala pamlyangu wuvawukema “Mlyangu wa Nyanyi” wa nyumba ya Chapanga, veni vajinga nendu hata vakamanyeyi ha chindu liki chimgolili nawula.</para>
  <para style="s">Himulilu ya Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yula mundu aveli akali hela kavakamulila Petili na Yohani. Vandu vosi, pavajingweyi nendu, vakandili kutuvila muudamwa wuvawukema “Mdamwa wa Solumoni.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi, Petili pavawonili vandu vala vakujuluvala kavawombela, “Vayisilaeli, wuli mukuyikang'anika filongu afi? Wuli mukutufulutulila mesu kucha kwa liwovi lyetu awu uwesu wa yufwi wumugola mundu ayu ayendiyendi? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Chapanga wa Ibulahimu na wa Isaka na wa Yakobi pamu na wa vagogolu vetu na mweni Chapanga yamjuma Yesu ndumindumi waki. Mumkamula awulayiwi, yumwi mwamlemili hata yingaveli Pilatu angamlekishelili ghavi pekesu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Avelili Mng'alili na goleki lakini yumwi mwamulemili, mumudayila mundu yula yawulagha vandu alekisheliwi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mwamuwulayili yula yaveli chikandilu cha unofu, lakini Chapanga amshukushili munjifwa. Yufwi vatovilela wa afi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mukumuwona mundu ayu yimummanyili kalijumila litawa lya Yesu limgola ghavi na liwovi, litawa lya Yesu nakujumila kwaki kumgola anani nakaka, ngimu vosi yimumuwona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Hinapawu valongu vangu, manya kucha yumwi na vakomi venu mumgolela Yesu chindochi pangajila mwaveni kumanya kucha mukugola chindu liki. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Chapanga agolili fila fya wombili kwa vambuyi vosi, yaveli Kilistu Mkombola dagobuliwi, ponopa ndi kagola chawombili. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mupomeli sambi shenu mumuwuyili Chapanga, chipindi dachiyisi mweni davawushili sambi shenu, <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mgoli nahawu ili Bambu avapi chipindi cha kutayiwa munda kandi davayegheli yula Kilistu Mkombola amshawulili mweni, ayu ndi Yesu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mweni asighali aku kumbindi mbaka payisa chipindi cha kukombola uswanu findu fyosi, ngimu Chapanga wadetili kupitila vambuyi vaki vang'alili vatangalili va dahili. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nongwa Musa adetili, ‘Bambu Chapanga wenu davayegheli mbuyi kucha nenga mumlima wenu. Na yumwi damumpikanishi findu fyosi fyavawombela. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi yampikanisha ng'odu mbuyi ayu datapuliwi kutali na vandu va Chapanga na kuwulayiwa.’ <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vambuyi vosi, kukandila Samweli na vala vayisili mumbeli, valandulili milandu yigoleka mumajuva ava. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ujangi wa Chapanga wadetili kupitila vambuyi vaki kwanongwa ya yumwi. Wuwula wula mukuva pamu mulilaghanu Chapanga lyagolili na vagogolu venu ndi kwanongwa ya yumwi, chipindi Chapanga amuwombilili Ibulahimu, ‘Kwa njila ya fileli fyaku vandu va mlima davanemiliwi.’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Topi, Chapanga amshukushili ndumindumi waki kwanongwa ya yumwi, amulayishili avanemeli usangi kwa kumgola kila mundu aghalambuki asileki njila shaki sha wafu.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chitemela cha Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Petili na Yohani pavaveghi vakali vakuvalandulila vandu yivayisili vatambika na vakomi va machonda va nyumba ya Chapanga pamu na Masadukayu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vandu ava vakalalili munu kwanongwa vandundami ava vavelili vakulandula milandu ya kushukuka kwa Yesu, ayi dayilangushi nakaka kucha vandu vasovili davashukuki. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi, vavakamula nongwa yaveli mbungamihi vavavikili muchijaka mbaka chilawu yaki. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lakini vandu vatangalili yivapikanishili unjangila wula vawujumila na vavelili valulumi alufu muhanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki, vakomi va Vayawudi, vagogolu na vawula va Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa vayikungili pamu aku Yelusalemu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vatanganikili pamu na Anasi mtambika mkomi na Kayafa na Yohani na Alekisanda na vamonga vavelili va lukolu lwa Mtambika mkomi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pavavawolushili Petili na Yohani pawulongolu yawu, vavadashili, “Yumwi mugola chindu achi kwa liwovi liki awu kwa litawa lya ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pala, Petili, aveli kamema Mfuki Mng'alili, kavawombela “Vakomi va vandu na vagogolu! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mani payiva mukutudasha chila chilongu cha nyanyi chagoliwili yula mundu yavelili chikwavakwava na ndambu yalowuliwili, <verse number="10" style="v"/>yumwi na vandu vosi va Isilaeli mumanyi lelu mundu ayu awolukili uswanu nakaka kwa litawa lya Yesu Kilistu wa Nasaleti, mweni mumuvangilila mulupingika, Chapanga kamushukusha munjifwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ayu ndi mweni chilongu cha nyanyi chadetili:</para>
  <para style="q">‘Ligonguveli mulilemili yumwi vajengi,</para>
  <para style="q">ponopa liva ligonguweli likomi lya kujengela kwa yosi.’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ulowola datuupati kwa mundu wingi ha, kwanongwa mlima wosi Kwa hela litawa lingi Chapanga lyatugayilili likuwesha kutulowola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vakomi va chitemela, vakamanyeyi kucha Petili na Yohani vaveli vandu vangajila kuyenda kushuli na vaveli vandu vasihisihi hela, vayikanganikili ndambu ya nyangulilu yawu ya uhwadali. Vamanyili kucha vaveli pamu na Yesu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini pavamuwonili yula mundu yivamlowulili Petili na Yohani vawoloka pamu na veni, vaweshili kudeta chindu ha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vavalayishili vafumi panji ya chitemela, ili vakomi va chitemela vawombani kwa chifisu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vakomi va chitemela vayidashili, “Tugoli wuli na vandu ava? Vandu vosi vayikala Yelusalemu vamanya muhilu awu wugolikili, yufwi tuweshi ng'odu kulema milandu ayi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lakini kugola milandu ayi yikotoo kukwila nesu kwa vandu, tuvakapushi vakotoo kulandula kwa mundu yoyosi litawa lya Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pambeli vavakema kandi munyumba, vavalayisha vakotoo kudeta na kuwula kwa litawa lya Yesu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini Petili na Yohani vavayangula, “Mulamuli mwaveni choti chinofu tuvajumili yumwi awu Chapanga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwanongwa yufwi tuweshi ng'odu kuleka kudeta findu fila tufiwonili na kufipikanisha.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vavaha va chitemela vavalakalila nendu, pambeli vavalekishela. Valemwa kuvapa asabu kwanongwa vandu vosi vaveli vakumjuma Chapanga kwanongwa ya chilongu achi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ayu mundu yagoliwili mihilu ya kulowuliwa aveli na myaka yasidili milongu mchechi.</para>
  <para style="s">Vamujumilili Chapanga vakudadava</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Petili na Yohani pavavalekili vawuya kwa vayawu, vavahimulila fila fivawombili vatambika vakomi na vagogolu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Veni pavapikanishili filongu afi vajova pamu pavadadava kwa ndima yimu kwa Chapanga pavadeta, “Bambu, yuwi ugolili kumbindi na mlima, bahali na fyosi fivelili, <verse number="25" style="v"/>udetili kwa liwovi lya Mfuki Mng'alili mumlomu wa ndumindumi waku, mgogolu wetu Dawudi:</para>
  <para style="q">Wuli vandu va mlima wosi vakwikalalila?</para>
  <para style="q">Mbona vandu vagola milandu ya hela?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vatavala va mlima vayitanda kala,</para>
  <para style="q">na vatavala vatanganikili pamu,</para>
  <para style="q">kumlema Bambu mkombola yashauliwili.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nakaka, Helodi na Ponsiu Pilatu na vandu va Isilaeli na vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi vatanganikili mumbwani kumulimba Yesu ndumindumi Mng'alili amushaghili mafuta ghavi mkombola. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vagolili milandu yila wiyilatili kala dayigoleki kandi kwa uwesu na Udayilu waku. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Deku, Bambu, uloli ndambu yivatukapusha ututangi vandumindumi vaku tulanduli chilongu chaku kwa chiganu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Woloshi liwoku lyaku ulowoli vandu tugoli filangushilu na filoja kwa litawa lya Yesu ndumindumi waku yang'alili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pavamalili kudadava, pahala pala pavavelili vatanganikila patikanyika, vosi vaveli vamema Mfuki Mng'alili. Vosi vayendelela kutyanga pavalandula filongu fya Chapanga ngajila lyogha.</para>
  <para style="s">Vayikalili kucha valongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vosi yivamjumilili Chapanga vayiwonili vava moyu wumu na hoshu silinganili. Kwahela mundu yavelili na chindu achivikili chivi chaki weka, vavaghanili fila fivakamulili. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vandundami vatovilelili kwa liwovi likomi kushukuka kwa Bambu Yesu na Chapanga avapili usangi utangalili. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yapotili chindu, vamu yivaveli na fitava na nyumba shawu vahemesha vayegha mbiya sivapatili, <verse number="35" style="v"/>mbiya asi shosi vavapili vandundami, vamgayilili kila mundu ndambu ya Udayilu waki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kwavelili Mlawi yumu, muwoneka wa Kupilu, litawa lyaki Yosefu, vandundami vaveli vakumukema Banabasi, mana yaki, “Mundu wa kuvakola mawoku vandu.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mweni wuwu aveli na chitava chaki pambeli kahemesha kandi katola mbiya sila, kavagayila vandundami.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Udesi wa Ananiasi na Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mundu yumu vamkemaya Ananiasi na mdala mundu Safila wuwula wula vahemishili chitava chawu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lakini Ananiasi afisili mbiya simonga sivapatili na mdamundu amanyili. Mbiya sisighalili avagayilili vandundami. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pambeli Petili kamudasha, “Ananiasi, kumleka Lijangavandu ayingili mumoyu waku kumujanga Mfuki Mng'alili kufisa mbiya simonga siupatili muchitava chila? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pawuvelili ukali kuhemesha chitava chaveli chaku, pambeli pawuhemishili, mbiya sila shaveli sikali shaku. Wuli kandi kugola findu kucha afi? Kumjanga mundu ha, kumujanga Chapanga!” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ananiasi papikanishili naha kawa pasi, kasova. Vandu vosi yivapikanishili milandu ayi vatilili nendu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vafijana vayisa, vagubika chikongu chaki, vachifumisha panji, vachisika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kucha masaa matatu pavapitili, mdala mundu ngajila kumanya chimfumbukili bambu mundu, kayingila mugati. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Petili amdashili, “Unongeli! Asi nakaka mbiya simupatili pamuhemishili chitava?” Mweni kamyangula, “Yina, sisesi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pambeli Petili kamuwombela, “Kwaliki muyijanga kumuyesha Mfuki wa Bambu? Pikani! Vala vandu vayendili kumusika bambu waku, ponopa vava pamlyangu na davakutoli na yuwi wuwu.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tepu Safila kawila pamawulu va Petili, kasova. Vafijana vala pavayingilili vamuwona kasova kala, vamufumisha panji, vamsika pabehi na bambu mundu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Chipwembwi chikomi chivakamula vandu vosi yivajumilili na vandu vala vosi yivapikanishili milandu ayi.</para>
  <para style="s">Vandundami vakugola mihilu na miwujawuja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vandundami vagolili mihilu na miwujawuja yitangalili kwa vandu. Vajumilili vaveli vakutang'anikila pamu muudamwa wa Solumoni. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mundu yangajila kujumila atilili kuva pamu na veni. Hata naha, vandu vamonga vangajila kuvajumila vavajuma. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vamjumilili Bambu, valumi na vadala vayongishekili mulipinga lyau. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vandu vavelili vakuyegha vatami mudeha vavawonjesha mufiwonjelu na mitefu ili pakapita livafiki lisisi lya Petili pambeli vanani. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vafumili mbwani shiveli pabehi ya Yelusalemu, yivavayeghili vatami vawu na vala yivaveli na finyamkela, vosi valowuliwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Vandundami vakugobuliwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pambeli, Mtambika Mkomi na vala vaveli lighanja muchipinga cha Masadukayu va pala, vavawonela weyi vandundami. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vavakamula vandundami, vavataya muchijaka. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini pamihi makungu wa Bambu kavafuwulila milyangu ya chijaka, kavafumisha panji, kavawombela, <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Muyendi mukawoloki munyumba ya Chapanga, mkavawombeli vandu filongu fyosi fya unofu awu.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vandundami vavayitikila, malavila puti vayingila munyumba ya Chapanga, vakandili kuwula.</para>
  <para style="p">Mtambika mkomi na vavaha va Isilaeli vagolili chitemela, pambeli vavalayishila vandu vakavayeghi vala vandumindumi kufuma kuchijaka. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini vala vandumindumi pavafikili kula vavawona ha mula muchijaka. Vawuya kuchitemela kuvawombela, <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Tuwona chijaka chitatiwa milyangu yosi na machonda vakulolela milyangu. Lakini patufuwulili mugati tumuwona mundu ha!” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mkomi wa machonda munyumba ya Chapanga na vatambika vakomi pavapikanishili milandu ayi vapatili lyogha. Vamanyili ng'odu chivafumbukili vandundami. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pambeli mundu yumu ayisili, kuvawombela, “Mpikani! vala vandu muvatatilili muchijaka, ponopa vakuwula vandu munyumba ya Chapanga.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mkomi wa machonda wa nyumba ya kudadavila pamu na vandu vaki vayendili munyumba ya Chapanga, kavayegha kuchitemela. Lakini vavakamulili kwa liwovi ha, nongwa vakavatileyi vandu vangavagumili migonguveli veni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pavavayeghili, vavawolosha pawulongolu ya chitemela. Mtambika mkomi avadashili, <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Twavakanishili nendu kuwula kwa litawa lya mundu ayu, ponopa mukwisha mawuli venu Yelusalemu yosi na mukuyilata kutugayila nongwa ya mwasi wa mundu ayu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Petili, pamu na vala vandundami vamonga, vayangula, “Yikutulata tumjumili Chapanga weka, lakini mundu tukumjumila ng'odu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yumwi mwamuwulayili Yesu kwa kumuvangilila mulupingika lakini Chapanga wa vagogolu venu amshukushili. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Chapanga amgayilili fwasi ya wutwa kumbindi, kamvika mwambu waki wa mlilu, kava mutwa na Mlowola, kuvagola vandu va Isilaeli vasileki sambi shawu na vapomeliwi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yufwi ndi vatovilela va filongu afi. Chapanga avagayilili Mfuki Mng'alili ghavi mtovilela kwa vala yivamjumilili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vanjagila vosi va chila chitemela pavapikanishili afi, maya sivakwila, valamula kuvawulagha. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lakini Mfwalisayu yumu vamukemeyi Gamalieli mweni avelili muwula wa Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa aveli na luhunja nendu kupita vandu vosi, kawoloka pawulongolu ya chitemela chila, kavawombela vala vandundami vavafumishi panji kwa chipindi chidokwa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawombela vala vanjagila va chitemela, “Vaisilaeli vayangu, muyivavali na chindu achi chimudayila kuvagolela vandu ava! <verse number="36" style="v"/>Dahili padokwa, afumbukili mundu yumu litawa lyaki Teuda, ayidumbeyi kucha mweni mundu yajumiliwi na vandu mya mchechi naha, vamukovekelili. Lakini vamuwulaghili, pambeli chipinga chaki chosi chimwaaluka pambeli chisova. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pambeli kandi, chipindi chila cha kuvalangiwa vandu, afumbukili Yuda wa Galilaya. Na mweni avakweyili vandu vamukovekela, lakini wuwu vamuwulayili na vandu vaki vayangalukili. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hinapawu nenga wuwu nguvawombela, muvaleki vandu ava mukotoo kuvagola chindu! Mana payiva milandu ayi ya vandu hela, dayiyamili yeni. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lakini payiva milandu kufuma kwa Chapanga, damuwesi ng'odu kulimbana na veni, damuvi mukulimbana na Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Topi, vamujumila. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vavakemili vala vandundami, vavadamula ndomondu na kuvakanisha vakotoo kuwula kandi kwa litawa lya Yesu, pambeli vavaleka vayendi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vandundami vafumili panji ya chitemela kunu vamema cheleli, kwanongwa vaveli vataywa musoni kwa litawa lya Yesu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Majuva vosi vayendilela kuwula na kulandula Chilongu cha Nyanyi cha Yesu munyumba sha Chapanga na mukaya sha vandu kucha Yesu ndi Kilistu yashauliwili.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Vatangi saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli, vanachuli pavayongishekeyi, kwaveli na shoshu na ng'ong'u gati ya vangutungu na vala yivaywangeyi Chibulaniya. Vala Vahelinisti yivaywangeyi Chigiliki vakang'ong'utekileyi kucha vangalimlyangu vawu vakuvavasuwa kuvagayila fivayilata fya majuva vosi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Topi, vala vandundami lilongu na vavili vavakemili vanachuli vosi, vadeta, “Nyanyi ha kwa yufwi tuleki kuchilandula chilongu cha Chapanga na kukimbanikila uvaghi wa filivi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ponopa, valongu vangu, muvashawula vandu saba kwa yumwi yivavelili nyanyi, vamemili Mfuki na yivaveli na luhunja na yufwi datuvapikanisheyi veni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yufwi, chipindi chosi datukimbanikili kudadava na chichuku cha kulandula Chilongu cha Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chindochi chivanowesha vandu vosi. Vavashawula Stefwani, mundu yavelili na ujumilwa mkomi na kumema Mfuki Mng'alili. Kandi vavashawulili Filipu na Pulokolu na Nikanoli na Timona na Pamena pamu na Nikolayi wa Antiyokiya yavelili chipindi chimu aghalambukilili mudini ya Chiyawudi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vavavika pawulongolu ya vandundami, vadadava na kuvavikila mawoku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Chilongu cha Chapanga chayongishekili nendu na vanachuli aku Yelusalemu vayongishekili kalopu na lipinga likomi lya vatambika vamjumilili Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Stefwani vakumutaya muchijaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Chapanga amusangilili Stefwani usangi ngenju, kamugayila liwovi likomi aveli akugola mihilu na miwujawuja kwa vandu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lakini vandu vamonga vayisili ili valimbani na Stefwani. Vamu va vandu ava vaveli va nyumba ya kudadavila yivayikemaya, “Nyumba ya kudadavila ya vandu yivavelili pekesu.” Vandova vafumili mlima wa Kileni na Alekisandilia na vamonga vafumili Kilikiya na mkowa wa Asia. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lakini vaweshili ha kumulimba kwanongwa ya luhunja lwaki na kwanongwa ya yula Mfuki yamulongushili chipindi padeteyi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi, vavapili nganyanga vandu vamonga vadeti, “Vamupikanisha Stefwani padeta filongu fya kumjowola Musa na kumjowola Chapanga.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwa chilongu achi vavajongishela vandu, vagogolu na vawula va Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa. Topi, vamwisila Stefwani, vamukamula na kumuyegha kuchitemela chikomi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vavayeghili kuchitemela vatovilela va udesi veni vawombili, “Mundu ayu akuleka ha kupajowola mahali pang'alili na Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa twamupikanishili kala padeta kucha ayu Yesu wa Nasaleti dayanangi nendu nyumba ya kudadavila na kughalambula Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa vatuyangili kwa Musa.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vandu vosi yivavelili mula muchitemela vamuwengulila mesu Stefwani, vamuwona wushu waki wuva kucha wa makungu.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandula kwa Stefwani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Topi, mtambika mkomi amudashili, “Wuli, milandu ayi yiva nakaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Stefwani amuyangulili, “Valongu vangu na vatati, mumbikanishi! Chapanga wa ukomi amubwitikili mgogolu wetu Ibulahimu paghaveyi kula Mesopotamia akali hela kuyenda kuyikala kula Halani. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Chapanga amuwombilili, ‘Wuki mumlima waku, valeki vandu vaku, uyendi mlima danikulangushi!’ <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ibulahimu ahamili mlima wa Kalidayu, kayenda kuyikala Halani. Pambeli tati wa Ibulahimu pasovili, Chapanga amuwushili Halani kayisa kuyikala mlima awu wumuyikala ponopa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chapanga amugayilili ng'odu hata chipandi chidokwa cha uganga chivi chaki kucha mbala yaki mumlima awu, hata naha vamujangili kumupa mlima wula wuvi waki na vana vaki, chipindi achi aveli akali na mwana ha. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Chapanga amuwombilili naha, ‘Chileli chaku dawuchiyeghi kumlima wa wutwa va vandu vengi, aku davavagoli vavanda na kuvagolela milandu ya wafu kwa chipindi cha myaka mya mchechi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lakini nenga dandivahighi vandu ava yivavagola vavanda. Pambeli chileli chaku dachiyisi mulima wula kumjuma Chapanga bahapa.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Chapanga kagola lilaghanu na mweni, topi, kamwingisha jandu ngimu chilangushilu chaki. Pambeli Ibulahimu amudumulili jandu mwana mundu Isaka pavapitili majuva nani kufuma awoneki. Isaka wuwula wula kamugolela Yakobi. Na mweni Yakobi kavagolela wuwula wula vala vanamundu lilongu na vavili veni vaveli vambuyi vetu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Vana va Yakobi vamuwonela weyi Yosefu, vamuhemesha Misili ghavi mvanda. Lakini Chapanga aveli pamu na mweni, <verse number="10" style="v"/>kamulowosha mungondu shaki shosi. Chapanga amugayilili fupu na luhunja pawulongolu ya Fwalawu, mutwa wa Misili, mweni amuvikili ghavi mkomi wa mlima wa Misili na munyumba yaki ya wutwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pambeli kwafumbukili njala ngomi mlima wosi wa Misili na Kanaani, yiyegha madaba makomi. Vagogolu vetu vaveli vahela chilivi chochosi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yakobi papikanishili filongu fila kucha aku Misili kwaveli na filivi, avalayishili vana vaki, ndi vagogolu vetu, vayendi Misili kwa mwanja wa kwaa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mwanja awu wa pili, Yosefu kayilangusha kwa valongu vaki na Fwalawu kavamanya valongu va Yosefu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yosefu alayishili lulayi layi kwa tati mundu Yakobi na valongu vosi, tolitoli ya vandu yaveli milongu saba na muhanu, vayisi Misili. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi Yakobi ayendili Misili, kula mweni na vanamundu vosi vasovili. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Fikongu fyawu vafiyeghili mbaka Shekemu, vafisika musembi yahemilili Ibulahimu wa kabila lya Amoli kwa mbiya siutunga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Chipindi pachifikili Chapanga agoli chila chamjangili Ibulahimu na tolitoli ya vandu kula Misili yayongishekili kala na kuva ngomi munu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pambeli mutwa yumu yavelili kamumanya ng'odu Yosefu akandili kutavala aku Misili. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Awugolilili vandu va mlima wetu umakuluhu, avagolilili findu fya wafu vagogolu vetu kwa kuvang'ang'anika vavaviki panji fyali fyawu fisovi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Musa awonikili chipindechi. Avelili mwana yamunowishili Chapanga. Aleliwili pakaya kwa chipindi cha myesi mitatu, <verse number="21" style="v"/>na pafumishiwili panji awulaghiwi, kamwali wa Fwalawu amutolili, kamulela kucha mwana mundu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Musa awuliwili findu fyosi fya luhunja lwa Vamisili kava mundu yaveli na liwovi kwa filongu na kwa figoli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Pafikishili myaka milongu muchechi alamulili kuvatyangila valongu vaki Vayisilaeli. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Aku amuwonili yumu wa vala vakumgolela fya wafu na Vamisili, kayenda kumukombola kandi kumuhombela lugotu kwa kumuwulagha yula Mumisili. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Akacheyi Vayisilaeli vayaki vangamanyili kucha Chapanga angamutumili mweni avalowoli, lakini vamanyili nawula ha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki, avawonili Vayisilaeli vavili vakwiminya ayeshili kuvajovesha padeta, ‘Yumwi muva ulongu nongwa liki, mukuyigolela wafu mwaveni kwa mwaveni?’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yula yaghaveyi akumutova muyaki kamusukumula Musa pambali padeta: ‘Ndi yakuvikili yuwi kuva chilongosi na muhigha wetu? <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wuli, ukudayila kung'ulaya kucha wumuwulaghili Mumisili yula lichu?’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Musa papikanishili filongu fila, atuvili kayenda kuyikala mumlima wa Midiani aku apatili vana valumi vavili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Myaka milongu mchechi payifikili, makungu wa Bambu amufumbukili Musa kuchivala chivelili chikuyaka motu kucheja pabehi na chidunda cha Sinai. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Musa kajinga munu kuwona chindu achi, kaselela pabehi ili ashungulili unofu, lakini apikanishili lishu lya Bambu: <verse number="32" style="v"/>‘Nenga Chapanga wa vambuyi vaku, Chapanga wa Ibulahimu wa Isaka wa Yakobi!’ Musa kabagama kwa lyogha na kayesha kandi ha kulembesha munu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bambu kamuwombela, ‘Wopoli mikobasi yaku kwanongwa pawuwolukili apa ndi mahali pang'alili. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nakaka ndifiwona findu fya wafu fivagolili vandu vangu kula Misili. Mbikanisha chivembu chawu, nenga nyisa kuvakombola. Ponopa, dandikuyeghi Misili.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Ayu Musa ndi yula vandu va Isilaeli vamulemili pavadeteyi, ‘ghani yakuvikili yuwi kuva mlongosha na muhighi wetu?’ Kwa deha ya yula makungu yamufumbukilili kuchivala chikayakeyi motu, Chapanga kamulayisha ayu Musa ghavi mkomi na mukombola. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mweni avalongushili vala vandu kufuma Misili kwa kugola mihilu na miwujawuja mulima wa Misili, kubahali ya Shamu na kucheja, chipindi cha myaka milongu mchechi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Musa mweni avawombilili Vayisilaeli, ‘Chapanga davashawulili mbuyi kucha nenga gati ya valongu venu vamonga.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Vayisilaeli pavayikungashili kucheja, Musa avelili kula kucha munjagila pamu na vagogolu vetu na yula makungu aywangili nayu kuchidunda cha Sinai. Mweni yayangili filongu fitugayila unofu atugayili yufwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Lakini yuyu, vagogolu vetu valemili kumupikanisha, vamusukumulila pambali, vakadayileyi kuwuya Misili. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vamuwombilili Haluni, ‘Tugoleli vamulungu, vatulongoshi njila. Tumanya ng'odu fimupatili ayu Musa yatulongushili kufuma Misili.’ <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vagola ling'omung'omu lya ngwada wa senga na kuchitambikila. Vachigolela lihungu chindu chivelili vagola kwa mawoku vawu veni. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Lakini Chapanga awukili pagati yawu, avalekili vajumi ndondwa sha kumbindi, kucha vayandikili muchitabu cha vambuyi va Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Yumwi vandu va Isilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q">Nenga ha mungayilili fupu na tambiku</para>
  <para style="q">kwa myaka milongu mchechi kula kucheja!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yumwi mwapapili libudi lya chapanga Moleki,</para>
  <para style="q">na ndondwa ya kuwumba ya chapanga wenu Lefani.</para>
  <para style="q">Ming'omung'omu yimuwumbili yeni mukuvajuma.</para>
  <para style="q">Kwanongwa ayi, dandivayeyi mateka kutali kupita Babiloni!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Kula kucheja vagogolu vetu vavelili na lila Libudi lya utovileli kucha Chapanga amulayishili Musa aligoli, ndambu yiyila yamulangushili Chapanga. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pambeli valipokela lila Libudi lya Chapanga kufuma kwa vambuyi vawu. Valeli vetu chipindi cha Yoshua, pavawutolili mlima wula kufuma kwa vandu avawushili Chapanga ngimu yiva fikili. Pala vayikalili mbaka chipindi cha wutwa wa Dawudi. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Dawudi atamwili na Chapanga, Dawudi amuluvili Chapanga amujengeli pakwikala mweni avelili Chapanga wa Yakobi. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lakini Solumoni ndi yamujengilili Chapanga nyumba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>“Hata naha, Chapanga Mkomi akwikalagha ha munyumba shivajengili vandu, kucha mbuyi adetili.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>‘Bambu kadeta,</para>
  <para style="q">Kumbindi chigoda changu cha wutwa</para>
  <para style="q">na mlima chigoda changu cha kuvikila mawulu.</para>
  <para style="q">Nyumba ya wuli wuli damuweshi kujengela na koti dambumulileyi?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nenga ndi yigolili findu fyosi afi ng'odu?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Pambeli Stefwani awombili, “Yumwi muveli na lukilu lukomi! Mundima na majeji venu mukupikanisha ng'odu unjagila wa Chapanga! Yumwi kucha vagogolu venu. Majuva vosi mkumulimba Mfuki Mng'alili. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kwaveli mbuyi yoyosi yangajila kuteshiwa na vagogolu vawu? Vavawulayili ava avatumili Chapanga kulandula kwisa kwa yula goleki. Hinapawu, yumwi mumushengeta, mumuwulaya. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yumwi muvapokela Malawu va Chapanga atuyeyilili makungu, lakini muvajumila ng'odu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kusova kwa Stefwani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Vala vagogolu va chitemela pavapikanishili afi, vakalalili nendu, vakelichula minu kwa maya. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Lakini Stefwani aveli kamema Mfuki Mng'alili, kalola kumbindi, kawona ukomi wa Chapanga na Yesu kawoloka mwambu wa mlilu wa Chapanga. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Kadeta, “Mloli! Nguwona kumbindi kufuwuliwa na Mwana wa Mundu kawoloka mwambu wa mlilu wa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Pala, vandu vosi vavelili muchitemela chila, vawuteyi na kudika majeji vawu kwa mawoku vawu. Pambeli vamujumbila pamu vosi. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Vamsukumulila panji ya mbwani, vamutova kwa miganga. Vala vavikili mikoti yawu kwa utovilela kwa kijana yumu litawa lyaki Sauli. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Pavaveli vakumtovanga kwa miganga Stefwani kayendelela kudadava naha, “Bambu Yesu, pokeli ufuki wangu!” <figure style="fig" desc="" file="19 Being Stoned.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="7:59">Mundu yatoviwa kwa migonguveli mbaka asovi</figure> <verse number="60" style="v"/>Katundama, kalila kwa kulandula, “Bambu, ukotoo kuvavalangila sambi ayi.” Pamalilili kudeta naha, kasova.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Sauli mweni awonili chindu achi cha kumuwulagha Stefwani chaveli chinofu.</para>
  <para style="s">Sauli akuvagobola vajumilili</para>
  <para style="p">Majuva ava lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu lya Yelusalemu lyakandili kugoboliwa nendu. Yivajumilili vosi vatuvila kufijiji fya Yudeya na Samaliya ila vasiyalili vala vandundami hela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vandu vasangi vamusikili Stefwani na kumugolela chivembu chikomi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Chipindi chichila chila, Sauli ayeshili kuvagobola lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu. Kayenda kaya mbaka kaya pakavafumisha panji vajumilili, valumi na vadala, kavataya muchijaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Chilongu cha nyanyi chikulanduliwa Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vamjumilili Chapanga kula kosi kwevatuvilili vayendili kulandula chilongu cha nyanyi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Filipu ayingilili mbwani ya Samaliya na kumulandula Kilistu Mkombola kwa venikaya va pala. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vandu vayisili kupikanisha unofu wa unjagila wula wa Filipu na kulola mihilu yila yagolagha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mana finyamkela fivafuma vandu vatangalili pavawuta kwa lishu likomi nawu vandu vatangalili vaveli vapombalili na vandevindevi valowukili. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwaveli na cheleli ngomi mumbwani yila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi, kwavelili mundu yumu vamukemaya Simoni, mweni aveli kagola kala uhavi waki mumbwani yila kwa chipindi chila, vandu va Samaliya vajingili, adetili kucha mweni mundu mkomi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vandu vosi, vadokwa na vakomi, vamupikinishili finofu vakadeteyi, “Simoni kana liwovi lya Chapanga vakemili ‘Liwovi Likomi.’ ” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vampikanishili wula vavelili vajingwa kwa uhavi waki kwa chipindi chitali. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini pavawujumilili unjagila wa Filipu wa chilongu cha nyanyi cha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na litawa lya Yesu Kilistu, vabatishilwi valumi na vadala. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Simoni nayu kajumila, pambeli pabatishiwi aveli akuyenda pamu na Filipu, ayikang'anikili nendu mihilu na miwujawuja yiveli yikugoleka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vala vandundami vavelili kula Yelusalemu pavapikanishili kucha venikaya va Samaliya veni vapokela chilongu cha Chapanga, vavayegha aku Petili na Yohani. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Veni pavayisili, vavadadavila vandu va Chapanga vamuyangi Mfuki Mng'alili. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwanongwa kwaveli kwahela hata muyawu yumu yasunukiwili na Mfuki Mng'alili, ila vabatishwa hela kwa litawa lyaki Bambu Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Petili na Yohani vavavikila mawoku, vamupokela Mfuki Mng'alili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Simoni pakawonili vandu vapokela Mfuki Mng'alili kwa kuvikilwa mawoku na vandundami, adayilili kuvagayila mbiya Petili na Yohani, kandi kadeta, <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Mungayili na nenga uwesu awu, mundu yoyosi panumuvikila mawoku vangu, apokeli Mfuki Mng'alili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini Petili amuyangulili, “Uyaghamili pamu na mbiya shaku muyaghamili! Yuwi ukucha dauweshi kuhemela kwa mbiya usangi wa Chapanga! <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yuwi kwahela chindu mumilandu ayi, ngunda yaku ya nyanyi ng'odu kwa Chapanga. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hinapawu, pomeli ughalambuki uleki chiuyihola na umuluvi Bambu mweni akuwesha kukupomela chilongu achi chiwuyihola. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Manya nakaka kumema nesu weyi na sambi sikutopela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Simoni kayangula, “Mudadavili kwa Bambu likotoo kumbata lya kumbata kwa afi fimudetili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Petili na Yohani pavahimulili kala na kulandula fyalayilili Bambu, vawuyili Yelusalemu. Pavaveghi vakuwuya vakalanduleyi milandu ya nyanyi mufijiji fitangalili fya Samaliya.</para>
  <para style="s">Filipu na mkomi wa Esopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Makungu wa Bambu amuwombilili Filipu, “Uyitandi uyendi kundenyeku kupitila deha yifuma Yelusalemu kuyenda Gaza.” Deha ayi vakutyangila ha. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Topi, Filipu ayitandili kala, akandili mwanja. Chipindi chichila kwavelili na Mwisopiya yumu, ufisa mvika mbiya wa Muhumbu Kandake, mweni aveli ngali mdala. Avelili kayenda aku Yelusalemu kumudadavila Chapanga na chipindi achi aveli akuwuya kakwela mumbutuka ya kukwegha na chihongu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Paaveyi mumwanja, avelili akusoma chitabu cha mbuyi wa Chapanga Isaya. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mfuki Mng'alili amuwombilili Filipu, “Yendi pabehi ya mbutuka ayi uyendi pamu.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Filipu kayenda mbilu, kampikanisha akusoma chitabu cha mbuyi wa Chapanga Isaya. Filipu kamudasha, “Afi fiwusoma fikuyingila muluhala lwaku?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kayangula, “Goli wuliwuli chinyingili ngajila mundu wa kunongosha?” Kamuluva Filipu akweni vayikali pamu na mweni. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Chifungu cha mayandiku avelili akusoma ndi achi,</para>
  <para style="q">“Kalongoshwa kucha fungami akuyenda kumsinja,</para>
  <para style="q">na kucha wula mwana wa fungami panyamala kwa yula yamuketula miwaji,</para>
  <para style="q">mweni akudawula ng'odu mlomu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vamujohola na kumukaja haki.</para>
  <para style="q">Ndi dahimulili chileli chaki?</para>
  <para style="q">Mana unofu waki kawushiwa kumlima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yula ngali mdala kamudasha Filipu, “Unongeli, mbuyi ayu filongu afi akadeteyi milandu liki, ndi milandu ya mweni awu ya mundu wingi?” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Topi, Filipu akandili na Mayandiku Vang'alili, kamuwombela Chilongu cha Nyanyi cha Yesu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pavaveyi mumwanja, vafikili pavelili na machi, yula ngali mdala adetili, “Loli, pavaveli machi ava, chindu liki chikunganisha ngotoo kubatishiwa?”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="20 Baptism.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="8:36">Mundu yabatishiwa</figure> <verse number="37" style="v"/>Filipu kadeta, “Mani pawujumila kwa moyu waku wonda, ukuwesha kubatishiwa.” Kayangula, “Yina ngujumila Yesu Kilistu ndi mwana wa Chapanga.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Topi kawolosha mbutuka, pambeli vasunuka vonda vavili vayenda mumachi, Filipu amubatishili. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Pavafumili mumachi, Mfuki wa Bambu kamubikula Filipu, yula ngali mdala kamuwona kandi ha. Topi kayendelela na mwanja kunu kava na cheleli buja. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Filipu kayiwona kabwitukila mbwani ya Azotu, paaveyi akupita akalanduleyi Chilongu cha Nyanyi mumbwani shosi, mbaka pafikili Kayisalia.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulowoka kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="r">Figoli 22:6-16,26:12-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lakini Sauli, kayongesha kuvagola vandu vatili na kuvawulagha vandundami va Bambu, kamuyendela mtambika mkomi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>akamluveyi baluwa kufuma munyumba sha kudadavila sha Damasku, pakatanganika na vandu vamujumilili Chapanga mudeha valumi kwa vadala avakamuli avayeghi muchijaka aku Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tepu paaveyi mudeha, pabehi ya Damasku, lwengi kufuma kumbindi lumng'alikili kumshengeta mweni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kagua pasi, kapikana lishu likumuwombela “Sauli, Sauli! Wuli ukugobola nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Sauli kamudasha, “Bambu, Yuwi ghani?” Kamuyangula, “Nenga Yesu, yugobola. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ponopa woloki, uyendi mumbwani, davakuwombeli chindu cha kugola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vala vandu yivaveli pamu na Sauli mumwanja vanyamalili jii, vakapikanisheyi lishu, lakini vamuwonili mundu ng'odu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Sauli atandamukili pasi agubutulili mesu vaki kachiwona chindu ha, vamukamula liwoku vamlongosha mbaka Damasku. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ayikalili majuva matatu ngajila kulola, kulanda na kulya chindu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Paaveyi Damasku ndundami yumu yivamkemili Ananiasi. Bambu amukemili mumilotu, “Ananiasi!”</para>
  <para style="p">Kayangula, “Nengapa, Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bambu amuwombilili, “Woloki, uyendi deha yivayikema ‘Yiholukili,’ mbaka kaya ya Yuda, kuna mundu litawa lyaki Sauli, kafuma Talisu, mweni akumdadavila Chapanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Chapanga amulanushili kucha mundu yumu litawa lyaki Ananiasi, kayisa kumuvikila mawoku, aweshi kulola kandi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ananiasi kayangula, “Bambu, mbikanisha filongu fya wafu fya mundu ayu kufuma kwa vandu vatangalili, kagola findu fitangalili kwa vang'alili vaku aku Yelusalemu, <verse number="14" style="v"/>kandi vatambika vakomi va Damasku vamjumisha avakamuli vonda yivakudadavila mulitawa lyaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini Bambu kamuwombela Ananiasi, “Uyendi, nongwa ayu ndimushawula andangi nenga kulilandula litawa lyangu limanyiki kwa vandu vangajila Vayawudi, vatwa na vandu va Isilaeli. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kandi dandimulangushi ndambu dagoboleki kwanongwa ya litawa lyangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ananiasi ayendili munyumba yila, kayingila mugati mwavelili Sauli, pambeli kamuvikila mawoku, pakadeta, “Mlongu wangu Sauli, Bambu Yesu kanayila, yakufumbukilili mudeha pawuyiseyi apa, mweni yanyeyili nenga apa, akudayila uloli kandi na umemeshwi Mfuki Mng'alili.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tepu fiponeka kufuma mumesu vaki kucha mipati ya somba, kawesha kulola kandi. Kawoloka na kubatishiwa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pambeli kalya filivi, liwovi limuwuyila kandi.</para>
  <para style="s">Sauli akulandula aku Damasku</para>
  <para style="p">Sauli ayikalili Damasku na vanachuli vaki padokwa hela. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tepu, kalongosha kulandula munyumba sha kudadavila kacha Yesu aveli Mwana wa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vosi vamupikanisheyi vajinga, pavayidasha, “Ayu yuyula yula ng'odu avawulayei vandu vosi vamujumilili Yesu aku Yelusalemu? Na mweni kayisa apa kayilata avakamuli vandu vosi ng'odu na avayeghi kwa vatambika vakomi va nyumba ya kudadavila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Sauli ayongeshikili liwovi nendu, avagolili Vayawudi vavelili Damasku vayipwelishili, padeta ayu ndi Kilistu yaveli mkombola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pavapitili majuva vatangalili, Vayawudi vawombanila ndambu davamuwulaghi Sauli, <verse number="24" style="v"/>lakini Sauli amanyili chivayilatili. Pamusi na pamihi vakamulembeleleyi mumilyangu ya mbwani vamuwulaghi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pamihi vanachuli yivaveli pamu na Pauli vamtolili vamusunusha mulitandavala likomi kufuma mulilanga lya luviu lwa mbwani.</para>
  <para style="s">Sauli akuwuya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Sauli pafikili Yelusalemu, ayeshili kuyihasha na vandundami, vosi vakamutileyi, vajumilili ng'odu kucha nakaka kava ndundami. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Banabasi amutolili, kamuyegha kwa vandundami, Sauli avawombilili ndambu atanganikili na Bambu mudeha, kandi Bambu aywangili na mweni na ndambu akalanduleyi litawa lya Yesu kula Damasku kwa liwovi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Sauli ayikalili pamu na veni na kuyendayenda Yelusalemu yosi, palandula litawa lya Yesu ngajila lyova. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Awombili palimbana na vangutungu va Vayawudi, lakini veni vasakeyi kumuwulagha. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini valongu pavamanyili milandu ya kumuwulagha vamutolili mbaka mbwani ya Kayisalia, vamuleka ayendi Talisu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Topi, Vajumilwa vaveli vasika mu Yudeya yosi, Galilaya na Samaliya, Mfuki Mng'alili atangili kuyongesha lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu na vayikalili pavamtila Bambu.</para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumulowola Anea na Dolikasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Petili pavatyangileyi mbembi shosi mumlima, mweni ayendili kwa vandu va Chapanga va aku Lida. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Amuwonili mundu yumu aku, litawa lyaki Anea mundu ayu apombalili awonjili muchiwonjelu myaka minani. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Petili amuwombilili, “Anea, Yesu Kilistu kakulowola, wuki unyengi chiwonjelu chaku.” Tepu katandamuka. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vayikalaya Lida na Shaloni pavamuwonili Anea, vamuwuyilila Bambu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ndumindumi yumu avelili Yopa, yivamkemeyi Tabita, mana yaki kucha “Mbalapi” yajumilili vamkemaya Dokasi kwa Chigiliki. Mdala ayu avelili kagola findu fitangalili fya nyanyi pamu na kuvatanga vagaju. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Chipindi chila mdala yula atamwili na kusova, vawofuwili chikongu chaki vachivikili muchumbagati cha mumbindi. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yopa yavelili kutali nesu ha na Lida, vanachuli vapikanishili Petili kava kula, valayisha vandu vavili vamuyegheli unjagila, “Lopukeshi ukotoo kuhava!” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Petili kawuka kayilongosha na veni, pakafikili vamuyegha kuchumba cha mumbindi, vangalimlyangu vosi vawolukili pabehi yaki, vakalileyi na kumulangusha mihabiti na yingwa shasonili Dokasi chipindi paveli mnofu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Petili kavafumisha panji vosi, katundama, kamdadava Chapanga, pambeli kaselela kuchikongu, kadeta, “Tabita yimuki.” Mweni kafumbula mesu vaki, amuwonili Petili kayimuka kayikala. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kamkamula liwoku kawoloka, pambeli kavakema vamjumilili Yesu na vangalimlyangu kamuvika pawulongolu yawu, kava munofu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Milandu ayi yamanyikili mumbwani yosi ya Yopa, vandu vatangalili vamujumilili Bambu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Topi, Petili ayikalili Yopa majuva vatangalili, kayaki mundu yumu, litawa lyaki Simoni, yagolagha findu fya ngwembi.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Petili na Kolineli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kula Kayisalia pavelili mundu yumu, litawa lyaki Kolineli, mkomi wa machonda va Italiya yivayikemili, “Kombaniya ya Vaitalia.” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Avelili mundu msangi, mweni na nyumba yaki yosi, akovekelagha Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa avelili akuvatanga vagaju na kumudadavila Chapanga majuva vosi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yavelili pamusi saa tisa, Chapanga amlangushili palola ngatu hela, makungu wa Chapanga, kamuyisila kumuwombela, “Kolineli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kolineli kamulolesha nesu makungu ayu kwa lyova, kadeta, “Kuna liki Bambu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Makungu kamuyangula, “Chapanga kasiyanga dadavu shaku na fupu wala dakuvasiwi ng'odu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hinapawu, valayishi vandu Yopa, vakamukemi Simoni, litawa lyaki lingi Petili. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mweni muhenja wa mundu yumu, litawa lyaki Simoni, mugola chichuku sha ngwembi, nyumba yaki ya muluwongu ya bahali.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yula makungu akaywangeyi nayu pawukili kala, Kolineli avakemili vagolafichuku vaki vavili va munyumba na machonda yumu yamumanyili Chapanga. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pavawombilili kala findu fyosi fifumbukili, kavalayisha vayendi Yopa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki, pavaveghi mumwanja pabehi na mumbwani, Petili akwenili kulipaghali, kadadava kwa Chapanga, lijuva lyaveli palundosi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Njala yamutamili, akadayileyi chindu cha kulya, pavaveghi vakumutelekela, kashulula, <verse number="11" style="v"/>awonili kumbindi kufuwuka, chisunuka kucha yingwa ngomi, yikusunushwa pasi yikamuliwa na mbembi shaki mchechi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mugati yaki mwavelili vang'ongolu vosi vaveli na mawulu, vala vakwava na vambongu vawuluka kululanga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pambeli kapikana lishu limlongela, “Petili tandamuki, kawulayi wulyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini Petili kadeta, “Ng'odu Bambu! Ngali hela kulya chindu chiveli cha wafu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lishu limuwombela kandi lideta, “Fyang'alishili Chapanga, kotoo kufikema fyawafu.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Chindu achi chiyeleka mala ndatu, pambeli yila yingwa yiwuya kumbindi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Petili aveli akunyumanyuma akwipwelesha mumunda yaki, milotu ayi ayiwonili yina mana liki, vala vandu avalayilili Kolineli, vakakonyesheleyi nyumba ya Simoni vawolukili pawulongolu ya mlyangu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vakakemeyi panji kwa lishu likomi, “Kwaveli mhenja litawa lyaki Simoni Petili, akwikala amu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Petili aveli akwihola chila chalangushilwi na Chapanga, Mfuki Mng'alili kamuwombela, “Pikani! Pavaveli vandu vatatu vakukusaka. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ulopukeshi, usunuki uwuki pamu na veni, kotoo kuva na hoshu, nenga ndivalayisha.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Petili kasunuka pasi, kavawombela vandu vala, “Yumumsaka nengapa. Muyisa muyilata liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Veni vayangula, “Kolineli mkomi wa machonda katulayisha, vamuwombela mundu yaveli goleki yamujumila Chapanga, mweni mundu msangi kupita vandu vosi va mlima wa Vayawudi. Makungu kamuwombela atulayishi tuyisi tukuwombeli uyendi kayaki, apikanishi filongu fyaku dawumuwombeli.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Petili kavalibushila munyumba vavi vahenja vaki vawonja pala.</para>
  <para style="p">Chilawu yaki kawuka na vala pamu na vandu vamonga vamujumilili Bambu vayikalaya Yopa vamukovekelili. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki vafikili Kayisalia. Kolineli avelili akumvetela Petili aveli na valongu mundu na vaghanja vaki va pabehi yivalalikili. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Petili payingileyi, Kolineli afumili panji kumuyanga, kamutundamila na kamugondamila Petili mbaka pasi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Petili kamutandamusha, kadeta, “Woloki, nenga mundu hela kucha yuwi.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pakawombeyi nayu kunu vakwingila munyumba, kaliwona lipinga likomi lya vandu vayikungasha pamu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petili kavawombela, “Yumwi mumanya nendu mwiku kwa Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa mundu yavelili Muyawudi kuyihasha awu kuyityangila na vandu va milima yingi. Lakini Chapanga kanangusha ngotoo kumukema mundu yoyosi yapiyalili awu wa wafu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa ayi, pamungemili jumila nyisa ngajila kususuvila, topi nguvadasha, chimungemilili nenga chindu liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kolineli kadeta, “Majuva matatu vapitili, chipindi kucha achi, cha saa tisa mbungamihi, padadaveyi kwa Chapanga munyumba yangu, melili nimwona mundu kawoloka pawulongolu pangu, avelili na yingwa sing'alili. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kadeta, ‘Kolineli! Chapanga kapikanisha pawudadava na fupu shaku dasivasuvi ng'odu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Valayishi vandu vayendi Yopa, vakamukemi Simoni Petili, akwikalagha mukaya ya Simoni mugola chichuku sha ngwembi yayikala muluwongu ya bahali.’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Tepu, ndivalayisha vandu kwa yuwi, kugola nyanyi kwisa. Hinapawu twawosi twabaha pawulongolu ya Chapanga tukupikanisha filongu fyosi fyakulamulili Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulandula kwa Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Petili akandili kudeta, “Nakaka ponopa manya Chapanga kavahela lushawu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi yamjuma Chapanga na yaveli goleki, dajumiliwi na mweni. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Chilongu achi chavayeghilili vana va Isilaeli kulandula Chilongu cha Nyanyi yichiyegha kusika kwa deha ya Yesu Kilistu ndi Bambu wa vonda. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yumwi chindu achi muchimanya, chikwila mlima wosi wa Yudeya, kukandila Galilaya, unjagila walandulili kala Yohani Mbatisha. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Milandu ya Yesu wa Nasaleti, Chapanga amushawulili amumemishili Mfuki Mng'alili na liwovi. Mweni kayenda kosi, pagola chichuku cha nyanyi kavalowola vosi yivaveli muliwovi lya Lijangavandu. Nongwa Chapanga aveli pamu na mweni. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yufwi vatovilela va milandu yosi yagolili mumlima wa Uyawudi na Yelusalemu vamuwulaghili na kumutumbika mlupingika. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Chapanga amushukushili mulijuva lya tatu tangila pasovili na kumugola awoneki, <verse number="41" style="v"/>kwa vandu vonda ha, ila kwa vatovilela yivashawuliwili kala na Chapanga, yufwi yina, tulya na tulanda pamu na mweni pashukukili kufuma munjifwa. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Katulayisha tuvalandulili vandu, pavawombela kucha Chapanga amshawulili Yesu kuvahigha yivaveli vanofu na yivasovili. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Vambuyi va Chapanga vosi vakumuywangila, kucha mundu yoyosi yamujumila, kwa liwovi lya litawa lyaki dawushiwi sambi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vangutungu vakumpokela Mfuki Mng'alili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Petili paghaveyi akali akudeta filongu afi, Chapanga kavasunushila Mfuki Mng'alili vandu vonda yivapikanisheyi unjagila waki. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Vayawudi vajumilili yivayisili na Petili kufuma Yopa vajinga kuwona wuwula wula Chapanga kavamemesha vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi Mfuki Mng'alili. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nongwa vavapikanishili pavadeta ndambu yingajila kumanyika na kumujuma Chapanga. Petili kadasha, <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Vandu yivamupokilili Mfuki Mng'alili kucha yufwi, ghani daweshi kuvakanisha ava vakotoo kabatishiwa kwa machi?.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kalayisha vabatishiwi kwa litawa lya Yesu Kilistu. Pambeli vamuluvili Petili ayikali nawu kwa majuva madokwa.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Petili akuvahimulila Vakilistu mwanja waki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Vandundami na valongu vavelili Yudeya vapikanili kucha vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi na veni vachiyangili chilongu cha Chapanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Topi, Petili pawuyili Yelusalemu, Vayawudi vamjumilili vakadayileyi vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi vayingishiwi jandu, <verse number="3" style="v"/>vakadeteyi, “Yuwi vayendili kuyikala kwa vandu vangajila jandu na kulya na veni!” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Petili akandili kuvawombela kwa chiganu chindu chigolikili kufumila pa kwandi,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Lijuva limu pandimudadavila Chapanga mbwani ya Yopa, ng'ona milotu, chindu kucha yingwa ngomi yiveli na mbembi mchechi yikusunushiwa kufuma kumbindi yiwoloka pawulongolu yangu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Panolili chindu chila mugati nivawona vang'ongolu va mkaya vaveli na mawulu mchechi na vang'ongolu va mudasi, vala vakwava na vambongu va kululanga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pambeli mbikanila lishu likung'ombela, ‘Petili toli, uyendi ukavasinji, wuvalyi.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini nenga nyangula, ‘Ng'odu Bambu! Mana chindu chamwiku awu chawafu chiweshi ng'odu kuyingila mumulomu wangu.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lishu lila lyanyangulili kandi kufuma kumbindi, ‘Fyawumbili Chapanga kafigola fing'alili kotoo kufikema findu fyawafu.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Chindu achi chigoleka myanja mitatu, pambeli findu fyosi fibikuliwa kandi kumbindi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tepu, vandu vatatu vayisili pawulongolu ya nyumba yindiyikaleyi, valayishwa kufuma Kayisalia vayisi kwa nenga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mfuki Mng'alili kang'ombela nyendi na veni, ngotoo kuva na hoshu. Valongu ava sita yivajumilili tuyilongosha pamu kuyenda Kaisalea tuyingila munyumba ya Kolineli. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mweni katuwombela ndambu amuwonili makungu yawolukili panyumba yaki na kumuwombela, ‘Valayishi vandu vayendi Yopa vakamukemi Simoni, litawa lyaki lingi Petili. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Dakuwombeli filongu fyeni dafikulowoli yuwi na vandu vosi va kayaku.’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pangandeyi kudeta, Mfuki Mng'alili kavasunukila kucha patusunukilili yufwi pa kwandi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ngumbuka chilongu chadetili Bambu, ndambu adetili, ‘Yohani Mbatisha abatishili kwa machi, lakini yumwi damubatishwi kwa Mfuki Mng'alili.’ <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mani Chapanga kavapa veni fupu yiyila yila kucha yatugayilili yufwi patumujumila Bambu Yesu Kilistu, nenga ghani mbaka nyesi kumulimba Chapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pavapikanishili filongu afi valeka kulimba vamujuma Chapanga, pavadeta, “Chapanga kavatanga Vangutungu vapomeli na vapati unofu!”</para>
  <para style="s">Vandu va Chapanga aku Antiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vala yivajumilili chipindi achi vapwililikili kwanongwa ya kugoboliwa na kuwulayiwa kwa Stefwani, vayendili mbaka Foiniki na Kupilu na Antiyokiya, pavalandula unjagila wula kwa Vayawudi weka hela. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini yivajumilili vamonga vaveli vandu vafumili Kupilu na Kileni, veni pavafikili Antiyokiya valandulili Chilongu cha Nyanyi cha Bambu Yesu kwa vangutungu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Liwoku lya Bambu lyaveli pamu na veni, vandu vatangalili nendu vamujumilili na kumughalambukila Bambu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Milandu ayi yapikanikili kwa lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu aku Yelusalemu, vamulayishili Banabasi ayendi mbaka Antiyokiya. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pafikili kula awuwonili usangi wa Chapanga asekililili, avakuvilishili vandu vosi vayikali muujumilwa wa Bambu kwa ndima shawu shosi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Banabasi aveli mundu msangi yamemili Mfuki Mng'alili na ujumilwa na vandu vatangalili vayongisheka na kumuwuyila Bambu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pambeli, Banabasi kayenda Talisu kumusaka Sauli, <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pamuwonili kala kamuyegha Antiyokiya, vosi vavili kwa chipindi cha mwaka vayikalili pamu na lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu kunyumba ya Chapanga na pavawula lipinga likomi lya vandu. Kula Antiyokiya vavelili vandundami va kwaa kukanda kuvakema Vakilistu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vayisili vambuyi vamu va Chapanga yivafumili Yelusalemu kuyenda Antiyokiya. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Muyawu yumu litawa lyaki Agabasi, awolukili kadeta kwa Mfuki Mng'alili kucha dayiyisi njala ngomi mlima wosi awu. Yeni dayiyisi chipindi cha wutwa wa Kilawudiu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vala vandundami, kila mundu ndambu yaweshili, avatangili vala yivamjumilili Kilistu yivayikaleyi Yudeya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vagolili nawula, pambeli, vavayeghilili mbiya vagogolu va vandu va Chapanga kwa mawoku va Banabasi na Sauli.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Vakilistu vagobuliwa nesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chipindi chichi, mutwa Helodi akandili kuvagobola lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Amuwulaghili Yakobi, mlongu waki Yohani kwa limayi likomi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paawonili kavanowesha Vayawudi, kayenda kandi akamukamuli Petili. Majuva vala vavelili majuva va mibumunda. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pavamukamulili kala, kamuvika muchijaka kamtaya mumawoku va fipinga mchechi fya machonda mchechi mchechi vamuloleli, Helodi akadayileyi chipindi cha Lihungu pachipita amfumishi na kumuhigha pawulongolu pa vandu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Petili vamuvikili muchijaka, lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu vadadavili kwa Chapanga kwanongwa yaki kwa chiganu.</para>
  <para style="s">Makungu akumfumbukila Petili muchijaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Chipindi Helodi padayileyi kumfumisha, pamii Petili avelili kawonja pagati ya machonda vavili, kawopiwa mingongola mivili ya chuma na machonda vamloleleyi pavayipokela pawulongulu ya chijaka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tepu makungu wa Bambu awolukili pala, lwengi lung'alika chumba chila, kamgufya Petili, pamuyimusha, padeta, “Ulopukeshi! Tandamuki!” Mingongola ya mumawoku yawopusokili. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Makungu kamuwombela, “Uyiwopi lufunga, ufwali mikobasi yaku.” Petili agolili wuwula, makungu kadeta, “Fwali yingwa yaku ungovikeli.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Petili amkovikelili makungu kufuma muchijaka, ngajila kumanya ndambu yagola makungu nakaka awu akulota hela. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pavampitili mdima wa kwaa na wa pili, pambeli mlyangu wa chuma wa kuyingilila mumbwani, wafuukili weni. Vafuma panji, vapita deha yimu, tepu makungu kamuleka Petili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Petili luhala palumuwuyilili, kadeta “Hinapawu manya nakaka kucha Chapanga amuyeghili makungu waki, kung'usha mumawoku va Helodi na Chila vakashuvilileyi mlima va Vayawudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pamanyili afi afikili kaya ya Maliya, mamundu Yohani Maliku, vandu vatangalili vavelili vatangana amu pavadadava kwa Chapanga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Petili akutili mulyangu, mgolafichuku wawu litawa lyaki Loda, ayisili kumpikanisha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pakamanyili lishu lila lya Petili, kwa cheleli kufuwula ha mlyangu, katuva mbilu kuyingila mugati kuvawombela kucha Petili kawoloka pamulyangu panji. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vamuwombela, “Kuna lukwali!” Lakini mweni ayendilili kudeta nakaka. Topi veni vadeta, “Ayu makungu waki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Petili kayendelela kukuta pamlyangu, pambeli vamufuwulila, vamuwona mweni, vayikanganikili. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kavakupisha liwoku vanyamali, kavahimulila ndambu Bambu amufumishili muchijaka. Awombili, “Mukamuwombeli Yakobi na vala valongu filongu afi.” Pambeli afumili ayendili kwingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pamalavila machonda vayishoshili, kucha chindu liki chimupatili Petili? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Helodi avalayishili machonda vamsaki lakini vamuwona ha, avawombilili machonda, pavamuwona ng'odu alayilili vawulayiwi.</para>
  <para style="p">Pambeli Helodi afumili Yudeya kayenda Kayisalia ayikalili aku padokwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Kusova kwa Helodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Helodi kavakalalila nesu vandu va Tilu na Sidoni, vamuyendela mweni. Vagola lighanja na Blastu, mweni aveli mlolela wa nyumba ya mutwa, veni vayendili kwa Helodi kuluva kuvi na kusika, kwanongwa mlima wawu wapatili filivi kufuma mlima wa mutwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lijuva limu vayishawulili, Helodi afwalili yingwa sha wutwa, ayikalili muchigoda cha wutwa, akavalandulileyi vandu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vandu vakavikeyi umatu, vakadeteyi, “Ali lishu lya mundu ha, lya Chapanga!” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tepu makungu wa Bambu kamuwisha Helodi pasi, kwanongwa kamtundamila ha Chapanga, wambi vamulya Helodi, kasova.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Chipindi achi chilongu cha Chapanga chiyendelela kukwila na kukula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Banabasi na Sauli, pavamalilili kala kulandula, vawuyili Yelusalemu, vamtola Yohani yivamkemili Maliku.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Banabasi na Sauli vakushawuliwa na kulayishiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu lya aku Antiyokiya munyumba ya Chapanga kwaveli na vambuyi na vawula, vamu vaveli, Banabasi na Simoni yivamkema Mtitu na Lukiu Mkileni na Manaeni ayikalili kwa Helodi kandi kwavelili na Sauli. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pavamdadavileyi Bambu na kuyikaja kulya, Mfuki Mng'alili kadeta, “Mubawulili Banabasi na Sauli vavi na nenga mungimbaniku yila yindivakemilili.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pavamalili kuyikaja kulya na kudadava, vavavikila mawoku, vavaleka vayendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndundami vakulandula kula Kupilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mfuki Mng'alili avayeghili vandu ava vaselikilili mumbwani ya Seleukia, kufuma aku vapitili mubahali mbaka liwunguli lya Kupilu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pavaveghi Salami valandulili chilongu cha Chapanga munyumba sha kudadavila sha Vayawudi, veni vaveli pamu na Yohani Maliku avatangili mungimbaniku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pavapitili kala pagati ya lihunguli lyosi mbaka Pafu, vamuwonili mundu yumu muhavi Muyawudi yakemiwa Baliyesu, mbuyi wa udesi, <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mundu ayu avelili pamu na mkomi wa lila liwunguli Segiu Pauli, mundu yaveli na luhala munu. Mweni avakemili Banabasi na Sauli vayendi kayaki, akadayileyi kupikanisha chilongu cha Chapanga. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini yula Elima, mhavi kucha wuvakemiwa kwa Chigiliki, akayesheyi kuvalimba kumugola ayu mkomi wa liwunguli akotoo kuujumila Ukilistu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi, Sauli yivamkemeyi wuwula Pauli, amemili Mfuki Mng'alili, amufulutulili mesu muhavi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kawomba, “Yuwi mwana wa Lijangavandu. Yiumemili wafu wosi. Yuwi chimdwama wa chindu chiveli cha nakaka, kuva mjangi mudeha sha Bambu siholukili? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Loli, liwoku lya Bambu dalikwisili ponopa, dawuvi ngalimesu na ukotoo kuliwona lijuva kwa chipindi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Tepu, mesu va Elima vayingila lwisa, kashengeta shengeta akusaka mundu wa kumukamula liwoku na kumulongosha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yula mkomi, pawonili figolikili, kajumila, akajingeyi mawuli va Bambu.</para>
  <para style="s">Banabasi na Pauli mbwani ya Antiyokiya Pisidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pambeli Pauli na vamonga vawuka kwa watu mbaka Pafu, vafika Pagi, mbwani ya Pamfilia. Yohani Maliku kavaleka kawuya Yelusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini veni vawukili Pagi, vafikili Antiyokiya, mbwani ya Pisidia, Lijuva lya Kupumulila vayendili munyumba ya kudadavila, vayikala. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pambeli, pavasomili kala Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa na mumayandiku va vambuyi, vakomi va nyumba ya kudadavila valayilili mundu kayawu na kuvawombela, “Valongu, kucha pamuva na chindu cha nyanyi kuvawombela vandu ava, mudeti.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pauli kawoloka, kapunga liwoku, kadeta, “Yumwi valulumi Vayisilaeli na yumwi mumjumila Chapanga, mpikanishi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Chapanga wa Vayisilaeli, avashawulili vagogolu venu yivasovili, avagoli vavi mlima mkomi, pavaveghi vakwikala kucha vahenja mlima wa Misili, kwa liwovi lyaki avawushili, kavalongosha. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwa chipindi cha myaka kucha milongu mchechi avayiwunishilili kucheja. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Payanangili kala makabila saba va Kanaani kavagayila wuvi mlima wawu wa mbala. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwa chipindi cha myaka miya mchechi na milongu muhanu, Chapanga avagayilili valamula wutwa mbaka chipindi cha mbuyi wa Chapanga Samweli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Pambeli valuva avagayili mutwa, Chapanga kavapa Sauli mwana wa Kisi, mundu wa kabila la Benjamini, kwa chipindi cha myaka milongu mchechi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pamuwushili kala Sauli, amugolili Dawudi ghavi mutwa wawu. Chapanga awombili, ndimuwona Dawudi mwana wa Yesi, ndi mundu yanowiliwa na ndima yangu, dagoli fyosi fidayilili kugola nenga. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kufuma lukolu lwa Dawudi, Chapanga ngimu avajangili, kavayeghela Mlowola wa Isilaeli ayu ndi Yesu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akalihela kwisa, Yohani Mbatisha alandulili kala kwa vandu vosi va Isilaeli filongu fya ubatishu wa kupomela. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha paghaveyi akumalila chichuku chaki, adetili, ‘Mukucha nenga ndi mkombola? Nenga ng'odu mumuveteli. Mumbikanishi! Mweni dayisi kumbeli ya nenga, nenga ngujakwa ha hata kuwopola ng'oyi sha mikobasi yaki.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Valongu vangu, va lukolu lwa Ibulahimu, pamu na ava vayenu muveli nawu vamjumilili Chapanga, unjagila wa kulowoka ufika kwa yufwi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vandu yivayikala Yelusalemu na vakomi vawu, vamumanyili ng'odu Yesu mkombola, wala filongu fya vambuyi fyavasoma Majuva va Kupumulila, hata naha vatolili filongu fya vambuyi figoleki nakaka kwanongwa ya kumuhigha. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pavapotili nongwa ya kumuwulaghila, vamuluvili Pilatu amuhighi njifwa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pavagolili fyosi fimuyilatili mweni kufuma Mumayandiku, vamusunusha kufuma mulupingika, vamuvika kusembi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini Chapanga amushukushili munjifwa, <verse number="31" style="v"/>kwa majuva vatangalili ayilangushili kwa vala vayendili pamu na mweni kufuma Galilaya kuyenda Yelusalemu, ava ndi vatovilela vaki kwa vandu va Isilaeli. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Na yufwi tuyisa kuvayeghela chilongu cha nyanyi, chilongu chila Chapanga avajangili vambuyi vetu yivasovili. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Chapanga katugolela chavalayili vambuyi vetu yufwi vaisukulu vawu, kwa kumshukusha Yesu kufuma munjifwa. Ngimu iyandikilwi Mulumbombu lwa Pili,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Yuwi mwana wangu, nenga lelu ndiva Tati waku.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kandi mumilandu ya kumshukusha munjifwa, akotoo kuwuya na kuuleka mvili uwoli musembi, Chapanga awombili naha,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Damunyimbi nemusi sing'alili na sha nakaka shindimujangili Dawudi.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mahali pamonga Mulumbombu pakuwomba,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Chapanga dawumleki ng'odu Mng'alili waku awoli.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lakini ayu aveli Dawudi ha yamalilili chadayilili Chapanga chipindi cha unofu waki, pambeli asovili, vamusikili pabehi na vagogolu vaki yivasovili, mvili waki wa wolili musembi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lakini yula, Chapanga yamushukushili munjifwa kawola ng'odu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Topi, valongu vangu mumanyi, kucha kwa njila ya Yesu unjagila wa kupomiliwa sambi ukulanduliwa kwa yumwi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kila mundu yamjumila Yesu kavahela nongwa. Na nongwa yaku yingahighiwili ha kwa ugoleki wa Chapanga vamupili Musa. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Topi, muyivavali na milandu yivadetili vambuyi yikotoo kuvafumbukila yumwi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vambuyi vadetili, ‘Mupikanishi, yumwi yimuvelili na mbedalu,</para>
  <para style="q">mujingi muyaghamili!</para>
  <para style="q">Kwanongwa chigola panopawu chipindi cha yumwi,</para>
  <para style="q">chindu cheni damukijumili ng'odu hata mundu pakavawombela.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pauli na Banabasi pavafumeyi, munyumba ya Chapanga, vandu vavaluva vayisi kandi Lijuva lya Kupumulila lingi vavawombeli milandu ayi. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Likungashu lila palipelili, Vayawudi na vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi vatangalili vavelili vakukovikela deha ya kumkovikela Chapanga ya Chiyawudi vavakovikelili Pauli na Banabasi. Vandundami vaywangili na veni, vavakuvilishili vayendeleli kuyikala pavayidumba usangi wa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hata Lijuva lya Kupumulila liyisili, vandu vatangalili va mumbwani yosi vayikungashili kupikanisha chilongu cha Bambu. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Vayawudi pavawonili vandu vayikungasha, vamemili weyi, vafibedala filongu fyadetili Pauli na kumujowola. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Pauli na Banabasi vawombili kwa chiganu nendu vadeta, “Chilongu cha Chapanga chivi kwa yumwi tanila, lakini kwanongwa mwihigha mwaveni na mukudayiliwa kwikala jola, tukuvaleka tukuyenda kwa vandu va milima yingi. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa ayi Bambu katulayila naha,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Ngukuvika wuvi lwengi lwa milima,</para>
  <para style="q">uvayegheli vandu va milima yosi ulowolu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Vandu va milima yingi vasekilelili pavapikanishili chilongu chila, vajuma pavadeta, “Unjagila wa Bambu mnofu,” na vala yivavelili vashawuliwa kupata unofu wa jola, vamjumila Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Chilongu cha Bambu chikwila pala posi. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lakini Vayawudi vavatumishila vadadala vatawukili va milima yingi yivamumanyili Chapanga na valulumi vatawukili va mbwani ayi. Vakandili kuvagobola Pauli na Banabasi, vavavinga kuvayikaleyi. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Veni vavapundila lifu livelili mumawulu vawu kucha kuvakayika pambeli vayenda Ikoniu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Lakini vandundami yivavelili vamema cheleli na Mfuki Mng'alili.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Banabasi aku Ikoniu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kula Ikoniu, milandu yavelili kucha kula Antiyokiya, Pauli na Banabasi vayendili munyumba ya kudadavila kwa Vayawudi vadetili kwa kugangamala mbaka Vayawudi na Vagiliki vajumila. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lakini Vayawudi vamonga vangajila kujumila vavajongishela na kuvagola vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi vaghalambuki kufuma vandu yivajumilili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pauli na Banabasi vayikalili nesu, vakadeteyi kwa chiganu chilongu cha Bambu na Bambu alangushili unakaka wa usangi waki kwa kuvagayila liwovi lya kugola mihilu na miwujawuja. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lakini vandu va mumbwani vabavikili, vamu vavelili mwambu wa Vayawudi na vamu mwambu wa vandundami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pambeli, vandu vamonga va milima yingi na Vayawudi, pamu na vakomi vawu, vayilatili kuvagolela wafu vandundami na kuvaguma migonguveli. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vandundami pavamanyili chindu achi, vatuvilili Lusta na Debi mbwani sha Lukaonia na milima ya pabehi, <verse number="7" style="v"/>aku vavelili vakulandula chilongu cha nyanyi.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Banabasi aku Listila na Debi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwavelili mundu yumu aku Lusta kufumila awoneki aveli ndevindevi, akali hela kuyendayenda. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mundu ayu ayikalili pampikana Pauli yalanduleyi. Pauli amlolili kwa chiganu, kamuwona kana ujumilwa akuwesha kulowoka, <verse number="10" style="v"/>kalandula, “Woloki kwa mawulu vaku!” Yula mundu ndevindevi tepu katandamuka, akandili kuyendayenda. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu pavawonili chagolili Pauli, vakandili kuvika umatu kwa kabila lya Chilukaonia, “Vamulungu vatusunukila kucha vandu.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vamkema Banabasi Zeu na vamkemili Pauli Helimesi, kwanongwa mweni aveli mlandula mkomi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mtambika wa nyumba ya kudadavila ya chapanga Zeu awolukili panji ya mbwani, ayeghili likambaku lya senga na uluva pamlyangu wa kuyingilila mbwani, mweni pamu na lipinga lila lya vandu vakadayileyi vavatambikili Pauli na Banabasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini vandundami Banabasi na Pauli, pavapikanishili milandu ayi, vademula yingwa shawu, vayenda mbilu vayingilili mulipinga lya vandu, padeta kwa lishu likomi, <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Wuli mwabambu mukugola afi? Yufwi tuva vandu kucha yumwi! Tukuvalandulila filongu fya nyanyi, ili mughalambuki na kuyileka milandu ayi ya wafu na mumghalambukili Chapanga yaveli munofu, yagolili kumbindi na pasi bahali na findu fyosi fivelili. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pakwandi Chapanga avalekili vandu vagoli chila chivadayila veni. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hata naha, Chapanga avalekili ng'odu kuyilangusha kwa kuvagolela findu fya nyanyi, kuvatonyela ndonya kufuma kumbindi na kuvagayila filivi mufitava kwa chipindi chichila, akuvayikutisha filivi na kuvagayila cheleli.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwa filongu afi vavelili na chipindi chibalamili kuvakanisha vandu, vakotoo kuvatambikila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vayawudi vamu vayisili kufuma Ikoniu na Antiyokiya mumlima wa Pisidia vavajongishela vandu vayihashi pamu na veni, vamuguma migonguveli Pauli na kumukuluwula mbaka panji ya mbwani vakacheyi kasova kala. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini vandundami pavayikungashili na kumshengetela pambeli atandamukili, chilawu yaki kawuya kumbwani, mweni na Banabasi vayendili Debi.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Banabasi vakuwuya Antiyokiya na Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pauli na Banabasi pavalandulili kala filongu fya nyanyi aku Debi na vandu vatangalili vamjumilili Chapanga. Pambeli vawuyila Lusta na kutyangila Ikoniu pavayenda Antiyokiya yiveli Pisidia. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vavagolili vakamali vala vanachuli vala va mlima wula kandi vavataya munda vayikali muujumilwa wawu. Vavawulili, “Lasima tupitili mugoboleku sitangalili pambeli tuyingili muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vashawulili vavaha kila mu lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu, kwa kudadava na kwikaja kulya, vavavika mumawoku va Bambu yivamjumilili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pavapitili mlima wa Pasidia, vafikili Pamfilia. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pavalandulili unjagila wula kula Pagi, pambeli vayenda Atalia. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kufuma aku vawuyili Antiyokiya muwatu pala pakwandi pavanemiliwi usangi wa Chapanga kwanongwa ya chichuku, chivamalilili kala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pavafikili aku Antiyokiya vagolili likungashu lya lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu pala, vavawombilili milandu yagolili Chapanga pamu na veni na ndambu avafuwulili vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi kuyingila muujumilwa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vayikalili chipindi chitali pamu na vala vandundami Chapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ndanganilu ya vandumindumi aku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Topi, vandu vamonga vasunukili kufuma Yudeya kuyenda Antiyokiya vakandili kuvawula vala yivajumilili pavadeta, “Pamuyingila ng'odu jandu kucha Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa yivavadayila, muweshi ha kulowuliwa.” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Chindu achi chayeghili malimbanu makomi, Pauli na Banabasi vaywangili nawu, vavalayila Pauli na Banabasi pamu na vandu vamu yivajumilili va yila nyumba ya kudadavila ya Antiyokiya vayendi Yelusalemu kavalola vandundami na vagogolu yivayilatili chilongu achi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi, lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu lyavatawulili, na veni pavaveghi vakupita Foiniki na Samaliya vavahimulili vandu ndambu vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi pavamughalambukilili Chapanga. Filongu fila fyavagayilili cheleli vosi yivamjumilili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pavafikili Yelusalemu vayangiwa na lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu na vandundami na vagogolu, veni vavawombilili findu fyosi Chapanga fyavavagolilili veni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini yivajumilili vamu vavelili va chipinga cha Vafwalisayu vawolukili, pavadeta, “Vangutungu lasima vayingili jandu na kuvawombela vakombikeshi Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Topi, vandundami na vavaha vatanganikili kwa chindu achi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pavalimbanili nendu, Petili awolukili, kadeta, “Valongu vangu, yumwi mumanya kucha dahili Chapanga ashawulili nenga gati ya yumwi kulandula Filongu fya Nyanyi kwa vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi, vaweshi kupikana na kujumila. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mweni Chapanga yamanyili chivayihola kila mundu, avagayilili Mfuki Mng'alili vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi ili vajumili nakaka kucha watugayilili yufwi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Aveli kavahela lushawu gati ya yufwi na veni vang'alishili ndima shawu kwanongwa vamjumilili Yesu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi, nongwa liki kumuyesha Chapanga nongwa liki mukuvapapisha vandundami misiwu misitu hata vagogolu vetu, vaweshili ng'odu kupapa misiwu ayi? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yikotoo kuva naha, tujumila, yufwi datulowuliwi kwa usangi wa Yesu kucha veni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Chipinga chosi chanyamalili jii, chikavapikanisheyi Banabasi na Pauli pavahimulila mihilu na miwujawuja Chapanga fyagolili vandu kupitila veni kwa vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pavamalili kudeta, Yakobi akandili kudeta, “Valongu vangu, mumbikanishi! <verse number="14" style="v"/>Simoni ahimulili ndambu Chapanga dahili wavagolilili vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi, avatolili vandu kufuma veni vavi va mweni. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Chilongu achi chiva ngimu filongu fya vambuyi, kucha mayandiku vang'alili wuvadeta,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>‘Pafipela filongu afi dang'uyi,</para>
  <para style="q">na kugola libudi lya Dawudi ndiliwoloshi kandi,</para>
  <para style="q">dagoleshi pabowuyokili ndipagoli kandi na kuugola udindali kandi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apa vandu va makabila vosi davayisi kwa nenga,</para>
  <para style="q">vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi vosi vandivakemili vavi va nenga,</para>
  <para style="q">davamkovikeli Bambu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kucha Bambu ndambu wadeta, agolili chilongu achi chimanyiki kufuma pakwandi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yakobi kayendelela kudeta, “Mukotoo kuvagobola vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi yivamughalambukilili Chapanga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ila tuvayegheli baluwa kuvawombela vakotoo kulya filivi fya wafu fivatambikilili milungu wa ming'omung'omu, vayilyepi na uwoni, vakotoo kulya vang'ongolu vaveli fibudu na vakotoo kulanda mwasi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nongwa kwa chipindi chitali Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa vavelili vakusomiwa munyumba sha kudadavila shosi majuva va kupumulila vosi na filongu fyaki filanduliwa mumbwani shosi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Baluwa kwa vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi yivajumilili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vandundami, vavaha na lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu lyonda valamula pamu mulipinga lyawu kuvalayisha Antiyokiya pamu na Pauli na Banabasi. Topi vamshawula Yuda wuwula vamkemaya Balisaba pamu na Sila. Vavelili vakuhishimiwa nendu na yivajumilili. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vavagayila baluwa ayi, “Yufwi vandundami na vavaha, valongu venu, tukuvajambusha yumwi valongu va milima yingi yimuvelili aku Antiyokiya na Siliya pamu na Kilikiya. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tupikana kucha vandu vamonga yivafumili kwa yufwi vakuvaghasha na kuvayaghamisha kwa filongu fyawu. Lakini vagolili naha ngajila yufwi kuvajumisha. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yufwi tulamula kuvashawula vanjagila na kuvalayisha kwa yumwi valongu venu Banabasi na Pauli, <verse number="26" style="v"/>veni vajumila kusova kwanongwa ya litawa lya Bambu wetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa ayi tukuvalayisha Yuda na Sila vayisi kwa yumwi, veni davavawombeli afi fituyandikili. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Topi Mfuki Mng'alili na yufwi yitumjumilili tukotoo kuvayitwika msiwu nendu ila fila fivelili fitalama: <verse number="29" style="v"/>mukotoo kulya filivi fitambikiwili ming'omung'omu na mukotoo kulanda mwasi na mukotoo kulya fibudu na muyilyepi na uwoni. Damuvi mkugola nyanyi kucha pamuyilyepa filongu afi. Mwikali nyanyi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pavayitawulili kala, vala vandundami vayendili Antiyokiya kwavelili likungashu lya vala yivamjumilili Bambu, vavagayila baluwa yila. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pavasomili baluwa yila, filongu fyaki sivadindasha ndima, vasekelela nendu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yuda na Sila, vavelili vambuyi, vaywangili na valongu ava kwa chipindi chitali kuva sikisha moyu na kuvadindasha. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kwa chipindi chivayikalili kula, valongu va Antiyokiya vavatawula pavaluvila kusika moyu. Pambeli vawuya kwa vala yivavalayishili. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lakini Sila awonili ngiba asighali. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pauli na Banabasi vayendili kuyikala Antiyokiya pavawula na kulandula chilongu cha Bambu, pamu na vandu vamonga vatangalili.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Banabasi vakulekana deha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Majuva pavapitili Pauli kamuwombela Banabasi, “Tuwuyi tukavatyangili valongu vetu mumbwani shosi situlandulili chilongu cha Bambu, vakuyendilela wuliwuli.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Banabasi akadayileyi kumtola Yohani Maliku ghavi pamu na veni, <verse number="38" style="v"/>ila Pauli awoni nyanyi ng'odu kumtola Yohani Maliku kwanongwa avalekili kula Pamfilia, vayendili pamu ha mungimbaniku. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Topi valimbanili veni kwa veni mbaka valekana deha. Banabasi amtolili Maliku vayipaka watu vayenda Kupilu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini Pauli awukili na Sila, valongu va pala pavadadavilili kala vapati usangi wa Bambu, pambeli kawuka. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vapitili Siliya na Kilikiya kunu padindasha mipinga ya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Timotewu akwihasha na Pauli na Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pauli pafikili Debi na Lusta, kwayikaleyi mwanachuli yumu yivamkema Timotewu. Mawu waki aveli Muyawudi, lakini tati mundu Mugiliki. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vandu vamjumilili Bambu va Lusta na Ikoniu vamuhimulilili nyanyi Timotewu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pauli amudayilili ayu ayendi nayu, kamtola kamudumula jandu kwanongwa Vayawudi vavelili mwambu wula, nongwa vosi vamanyili kucha tati mundu aveli Mugiliki. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Topi pavavelili vakupita mumbwani yila, vavagayilili malaghililu vavikili vandundami na vavaha vavelili Yelusalemu, ili vasikamuli. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu vapatili liwovi kwa ujumilwa wula, vandu vayongishekili kila lijuva.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akulota milotu kula Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pauli na vayaki vapitili mlima wa Fulugia na Galatiya, Mfuki Mng'alili avakanishili vakotoo kulandula chilongu chila mlima wa Asia. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pavafikili kumbaka ya Misia vayeshili kuyenda Betaniya, lakini Mfuki Mng'alili wa Yesu kavajumisha ha. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vapitili Misia vasunukila Tiloa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pamihi Pauli alotili milotu, amuwonili mundu yumu wa Makedoniya kawoloka pala akumdedeka kumuwombela, “Jabuki, wisi Makedoniya wututangi.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Palotili kala milotu yila, twayitalishili kuyenda Makedoniya pangajila kukelwa kunu patumanya nakaka kucha Chapanga katukema tuvalandulili Chilongu cha Nyanyi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulowoka kwa Lidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tufuma Tiloa, twayendili kwa watu mbaka Samotilaki na chilawu yaki tufika Neapoli. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tufuma Neapoli twafikili Filipi, mbwani ya wilaya ya kwaa ya Makedoniya na wuwula wula vaveli pasi ya wutwa wa Loma. Twayikalili mbwani ayi majuva vautunga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mulijuva lya kupumulila twafumili panji ya mlyangu, tuyenda muluwongu lwa lweni, tukacheyi kuna mahali pa kudadavila Chapanga. Tuyikala, tuywanga na vadadala vatanganikili pala. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mdadala yumu, mwenikaya wa Tiatila, litawa lyaki Lidia amujumagha Chapanga, mweni ahemishagha yingwa sitalamili, mweni aveli msangi, kapikana, mundima yaki yifuwuliwa na Bambu, vavika filongu fyawombeyi Pauli. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hata pabatishiwi kala, mweni na vandu va munyumba yaki, katuluva, padeta, kucha muhigha ndiva msangi kwa Bambu, muyingili munyumba yangu muyikali. Katung'ang'anika.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Sila vakutayiwa muchijaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Patuveyi tukuyenda mahali pala pakudadavila, mvanda yumu mhinja yavelili akutunga atuwonili, avelili akuvalondulela valundamali vaki mbiya sitangalili kwa kutunga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Muhinja ayu kamukovekela Pauli na yufwi pawuta na kudeta, “Vandu ava ndi ndumindumi wa Chapanga avelili kumbindi, veni davavawuli ndambu ya kulowoka.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Agolili nawula kwa kila lijuva. Lakini Pauli yamunyekwili, kamghalambukila mhinja kamuwombela yula chinyamkela, “Ngukulayisha kwa litawa lya Yesu Kilistu, ufumi kwa mundu ayu!” Kamfuma chipindi chichila chila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Topi vabambu vaki pavawonili kucha chivashuvilileyi kupata mbiya chipela, vavakamula Pauli na Sila, vavakuluwulila pawelu kwa vakomi va mbwani. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vavatola mbaka kwa vahigha milandu, vadeta, “Vandu ava vakugola ndilingu mumbwani yetu na veni Vayawudi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kandi vakuwula milandu yeni kwa yufwi vandu va Loma tukujumishwa ha kusijumila na kusikovekela.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu vala vosi vavayendela na vala vahigha milandu vavawopusola yingwa shawu kwa liwovi, valayisha vavalatuli ndomondu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pavalatuwili nendu vavataya muchijaka, vavalayishila machonda va muchijaka vavadimi nesu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ya nayililu yila machonda avavikili muchumbagati cha mugati nendu ya chijaka kavawopa mawulu vawu mumingongola.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="21 Feet in Stocks.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="16:24">Vandu vavili vawopiwa mawulu mumingongola </figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mandandu Pauli na Sila vavelili vakudadava kwa Chapanga na kusomola mbombu sha kumjuma Chapanga, kunu vawopiwa vamonga vavelili vakuvapikanisha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Tepu pavelili na chiyighayigha chikomi, mbaka chikandilu cha chijaka chitikanyika, tepu milyangu yifuwuka na mingongola yilekana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yula mdimi wa chijaka kayimuka, kawona milyangu ya chijaka yifuwuka, akacheyi vala yivawopiwili vosi vatuva, kakwemula chimayi chaki, akadayileyi kwiwulagha. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ila Pauli awutili kwa lishu likomi, “Ukotoo kuyiwulaya, twawosi tuva baha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pamkemili kala mundu ayeghi luliku, yula machonda kajumbila mgati, kunu pabagama kwa lyogha, kavawila pamawulu va Pauli na Sila. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pambeli kavayegha panji, kavadasha, “Bambu goli liki ili nowuliwi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vamuwombela, “Mjumili Bambu Yesu, yuwi dawulowoki pamu na yivaveli munyumba yaku.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vamuwombela chilongu cha Bambu, mweni na vandu vosi yivavelili munyumba yaki. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kavalalika chipindi chichila chila, yaveli pamihi, kavawofuwa filonda fyawu, pambeli mweni na vandu va munyumba yaki vabatishiwa chipindi chichila chila. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pambeli kavatola Pauli na Sila kayaki, kavagayila filivi. Mweni na valongu vaki vosi vagola lihungu kwanongwa ayi ponopa vava vakumjumila Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki pamalavila, vahigha vavalayisha vakomi va machonda vawu pavadeta,, “Muvafumishi vandu ava vayiyendeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yula mdima chijaka kamuwombela Pauli filongu fila padeta, “Vahigha valayila vandu ili mufuwuliwi, topi ponopa mfumi panji, myiyendeli kwa kusika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pauli kavawombela, “Kucha chindu liki? Ingava twavelihela mbatiwa, vatulatula ndomondu pawelu kunu yufwi vandu va Loma, pambeli vatutaya muchijaka, ponopa vakudayila kutufumisha kwa chifisu? Ng'odu, vayisi veni vatufumishi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Vakomi va machonda vavawombela vahigha milandu ayi, veni vatilili pavapikanishili kucha vandu va Loma. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Vayisa kuvaluva vapomeli na pavavafumishili mugati, vavaluvili vafumi mumbwani yila. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Pauli na Sila vafumili muchijaka, vayendili kaya kwa Lidia. Aku vatanganikili na vakilistu na vavasikisha moyu vayenda.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kughayanika Mutesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kwa kupitila Amfipoli na Apolonia vafikili Tesaloniki, aku kwavelili nyumba ya kudadavila ya Vayawudi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Na Pauli, ayilumbili pamu kucha wuyivelili chishovi, awombanili nawu kwa chipindi cha majuva va kupumulila matatu yivayilongushili, pasoma Mayandiku Vang'alili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ahimulili na kulangusha kucha alatiwili Kilistu kuteshiwa na kushukuka. Kavawombela, “Ayu Yesu yindivalandulila ndi Kilistu.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vamonga vajumilili, vayilongosha na Pauli na Sila na Vagiliki vamumanyili Chapanga, vatangalili nesu na vahumbu vatangalili, vayihasha pamu nawu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini Vayawudi vawonili geli, vavatolili lipinga lya vandu kusoku vangali lusungu na vawafu, vagolili ndilingu mbwani, vavayendela vandu kunyumba ya Yasoni, vakadayileyi Pauli na Sila kuvayegha kwa vandu va mumbwani. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pavapotili, vamkukusha Yasoni na valongu vaki vamonga kwa vakomi wa mumbwani, vakawuteyi vakadeteyi, “Vandu ava vaghalambulili mulima vosi, vayisa na mumbwani yetu.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Na Yasoni kavalibushila na ava vosi vakugola milandu yiveli yilinganila ng'odu na Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa va Kayisali, pavadeta kuna mutwa wingi, vakumkema Yesu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwa filongu fila vakomi va mumbwani na lipinga lya vandu vapatili lyova. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yivagolili Yasoni na vayaki vahombi mbiya, pambeli vavalekiselili vayendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Aku Belea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tepu valongu ava vavayeghili Pauli na Sila pamii mbaka Beleya. Veni pavafikili kula vayingilili munyumba ya kudadavila ya Vayawudi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vandu ava vavelili vanyanyi pitu vala va Tesaloniki, vapikanishili chila chilongu kwa moyu wosi na majuva vosi vayiwulili mayandiku, kulola kucha nakaka chavawombela Pauli na Sila. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi, vandu vamonga vatangalili vajumilili na vadadala va Chigiliki vaveli na fyewu fikomi na wuwula valulumi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini, Vayawudi wa Tesaloniki pavamanyili kuva Pauli avelili akulandula chilongu cha Chapanga aku Beleya, vayendili aku, vakandili ndilingu na kuvatumisila lipinga lya vandu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vala valongu vamuyeghili Pauli kumbwani lakini Sila na Timotewu vasiyalili Belea, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vala valongu vamuyeghili Pauli vayendili pamu nayu mbaka Ateni. Pambeli, vawuya pamu na yalayishili Pauli kuva Sila na Timotewu valopukesi vamukovikeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuywanga na vandu va Ateni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pauli avelili akuvaveta Sila na Timotewu aku Ateni, mugati ya moyu waki akalalili nendu kuwona ndambu mbwani yila yamemili ming'omung'omu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi munyumba ya kudadavila awombanili na Vayawudi vamumanyili Chapanga na vala atanganikeyi nawu majuva vonda papiteyi mulipinga. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vamonga vakovikelili ndambu ya Epikulo na Stoiki valimbanili nayu. Vamonga vadetili “Akudayila kudeta liki ayu ndwangamlomu?” Wula Pauli avelili akulandula milandu ya Yesu na kushukuka, vamonga vadetili “Yikulangusha kucha ayu akulandula milandu ya vachapanga vahenja.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vamtolili Pauli, vamuyegha Aleopagu, vadeta, “Tudayila kumanya chilongu achi chashonu uvelili ukutuwombela. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Findu fimonga twapikanishili kwa majeji vetu fikuwoneka kucha miwujawuja kwa yufwi. Tungadayilili kumanya milandu ayi yina mana liki.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Venikaya va Ateni na vandu vamonga vayikalaya aku vavelili chipindi chawu chosi vakahimuleye na kupikanisha filongu fya shonu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Topi, Pauli awolukili pawulongolu pa chitemela cha Aleopagu, adetili: “Vandu va Ateni! Nguwona kuva yuwi, vandu mukukovekela deha ya kumukovikela Chapanga nendu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa ayi pambiteyi aku na aku na kulola milandu ya kudadava kwenu, ng'ona fyalu fiyandikiwa filongu afi, ‘Kwa Chapanga yangajila kumanyika.’ Topi nenga kulandula milandu yaki, mweni avelili mkumjuma yula mungajila kumumanya. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Chapanga yagolili mulima na findu fyosi fivelili, wula mweni ndi Bambu wa kumbindi na mlima, akwikalagha munyumba ya Chapanga yivajengili kwa mawoku ha, <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wala akutangiwa na mawoku va mundu ha, kucha akwilata chindu chochosi, nongwa mweni akuvagayilaya vonda unofu na Mfuki wa findu fyosi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mweni agolili kila mlima wa vandu vosi kufuma kwa mundu yumu, kuwesha kuyikala mlima wonda. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Agolili nahawu, ili milima ayi yimukovikeli na kucha wula kwa kuyibunula, mbaka yamfikili. Lakini hata naha Chapanga kakutali ha kwa kila mundu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kucha adetili mundu yumu,</para>
  <para style="q">Mugati yaki mweni, yufwi tukuyikala, tukuyiwesha na tuva baha!</para>
  <para style="m">Kucha vasomola lumbombu vamonga vadetili,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Yufwi vana vaki.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Topi payiva, yufwi vana va Chapanga, nyanyi ndili kuyihola Chapanga kucha chumang'andu, mbiya awu ligonguweli lya kusongola na kutayiwa malembu na mundu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Chapanga agolili kucha akulola ndili chipindi chila cha vandu vavelili vapufi lakini ponopa, akuvalayila vandu vosi kila mahali vapomeli. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nongwa kavika lijuva davahighi vamulima kwa haki, kwa mundu yula amshawulili, mweni kavagayila vandu vosi vawoni nakaka chilongu achi kwa kumshukusha mundu ayu kufuma munjifwa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pavampikanishili Pauli padeta chilongu cha kushukuka muchikongu, vamonga vasekili, vamonga vadetili, “Tukudayila kukupikanisha kandi chilongu achi!” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pauli kavaleka, kafuma kuchitemela. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lakini vandu vamonga vayilongushili pamu, vamjumilili Chapanga vavelili Dionisiu wa Aleopagu na mdadala yumu vakumkema Damali na vamonga.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli kula Kolindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli, Pauli awukili Ateni, kayenda Kolindu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aku Kolindu, amuwonili Myawudi yumu vakumkemaya Akula, mlelwa wa Pontu. Akula pamu na mwehi waki yivamkema Piliska, vavelili vawuya kufuma Italiya lijuva lilila, kwanongwa ya Kayisali Kilawudiu avelili kalayisha Vayawudi vosi vawuki Loma. Pauli ayendili kuvalola. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa veni vavelili vakugola mibudi kucha mweni, Pauli ayikalili nawu akugola chichuku. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kila lijuva lya kupumulila agolili maywangu munyumba ya kudadavila akayesheyi kuvakwegha Vayawudi na Vagiliki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Sila na Timotewu pavafikili kufuma Makedoniya, Pauli atolili chipindi chaki chosi kulandula, kuvawombela Vayawudi kucha Yesu ndi Kilistu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vamlimbili na kukanda kumjowola, kapunda yingwa shaki pawulongolu yawu padeta, “Pamuyaghamila mani mwaveni, nenga ndivahela mbatiwa yoyosi kwa chilongu achi. Kukandila ponopa dandivayendeli vandu va milima yingi.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Topi, afumili apa kayenda kwikala kaya kwa mundu yumu yamumanyili Chapanga vakumkema Titusi Yustu, mweni nyumba yaki yavelili pabehi na nyumba ya kudadavila. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kilispu, mkomi wa nyumba ya kudadavila, amujumilili Bambu mweni pamu na valongu vaki vosi. Vakolindu vatangalili vapikanishili unjagila awu vajumilili na kabatishiwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lijuva limu pamihi, Bambu amuwombilili Pauli kwa milotu, “Kotoo kutila kulandula, yendileli kulandula ngajila kuwuya kumbeli. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nenga dandivi pamu na yuwi, wala kwahela mundu dakugoboli na kukutesha, nongwa nenga ndiva na vandu vatangalili mbwani ayi.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kayikala aku chipindi cha mwaka wumu na myesi sita pavalagha chilongu cha Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Chipindi Galiu avelili mkomi wa Akaya, Vayawudi vamuhomkela pamu vamkamula Pauli, vamuyegha kuchitemela, <verse number="13" style="v"/>vakadeteyi, “Mundu ayu akuvakwegha vandu ili vamjumi Chapanga kucha valemili Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na Pauli padayileyi kudeta, Galiu kavawombela Vayawudi, “Mani chingavelili chilongu achi nakaka chawafu, yumwi Vayawudi yingavelili haki nenga kuvapikanisha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini leki yiva malimbu venu hela kuyilata filongu na matawa na Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa, mulamuli mwaveni. Nenga nema kucha muhigha wa filongu afi.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kavadagadaga vawuki pawulongolu ya chitemela. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Veni vosi vamkamula Sositenesi, mkomi wa nyumba ya kudadavila, vamtovanga pawulongolu ya chitemela. Wala Galiu akafiwoneyi filongu afi chindu ha.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuwuya kandi Antiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pauli ayikalili vakali na vala yivajumilili kula Kolindu kwa majuva vatangalili. Pambeli avayitawulili, kayipaka muwatu kayenda Siliya pamu na Piliska na Akula. Aku Kenikilea amowili fwili shaki kwanongwa yapingili mweni. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vafikili Ifesu, Pauli avalekili pala Pilisikila na Akula pambeli Pauli ayendili munyumba ya kudadavila, vahimula na Vayawudi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vamuluvili ayikali nawu chipindi chitali nendu, lakini adayilili ng'odu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Paaveyi akuwuka kadeta, “Chapanga padayila danyisi kandi kwa yumwi.” Awukili Ifesu kwa watu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Meli yawolukili Kayisalia, Pauli ayendili Yelusalemu kulijambusha lila lipinga lya vandu limjumilili Kilistu, pambeli kayenda Antiyokiya. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ayikalili aku chipindi chifupi, pambeli kayendelela na mwanja kupitila Galatiya na Fulugia kavataya moyu vanachuli vosi.</para>
  <para style="s">Apolu akulandula Ifesu na Kolindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Topi Muyawudi yumu, litawa lyaki Apolu, mlelwa wa Alekisandilia, afikili Ifesu, mundu ya manyili kuywanga, mweni amanyili unofu Mayandiku Vang'alili. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mundu ayu avelili vamulagha deha ya Bambu na wula ndima yaki yaveli sakalamu, akandili kudeta na kuvalagha milandu minofu ya Yesu, mweni amanyili ubatishu wa Yohani mbatisha weka hela. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Akandili kudeta kwa kugangamala munyumba ya kudadavila, hata Piliska na Akula pavampikanishili vamutolili kayawu, vamuhimulila deha ya Chapanga kwa chiganu nendu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na padayilili kujabuka bahali kuyenda mbaka Akaya, valongu vamukuvilisha, vavayandikila vala vanachuli vamlaliki, mweni pafikili avatangili nesu vala vajumilili kala kwa usangi wa Chapanga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nongwa avaweshili Vayawudi munu kwa vandu vosi, palangusha filongu fya Mayandiku va kucha Yesu ndi Kilistu.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli akulandula kula Ifesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chipindi Apolu avelili Kolindu, Pauli ayendili mwambu wa mlima wa fidunda, afikili Ifesu aku avawonili vanachuli vamu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kavadasha, “Wuli mwapokilili Mfuki Mng'alili pamujumilili?” Vamuyangula, “Ng'odu hata twakalihela kupikanisha kucha kuna Mfuki Mng'alili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kavadasha, “Ubatishu liki mwabatishiwili?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamuyangula, “Kwa ubatishu wa Yohani mbatisha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pauli kadeta, “Yohani mbatisha abatishili kwa ubatishu wa kupomela, pavawombela vandu vamujumili mweni yula dayisi kumbeli yaki, ndi Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pavapikanishili afi, vabatishiwa kwa litawa lya Bambu Yesu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pauli, pavavikilili kala mawoku vandu vala, Mfuki Mng'alili kavasunukila vala, vakanda kudeta kwa detelu henja na kulandula unjagila wa Chapanga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pavavalangiwili vaveli valulumi lilongu na vavili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kayingila munyumba ya kudadavila, kadeta kwa kugangamala kwa chipindi cha myesi mitatu, pawombana na vandu na kuvakwegha mumilandu ya wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lakini vamonga vaveli na lukilu, valema kujumila, vakanda kuywanga wafu kuyilata deha ya Bambu mulipinga lya vandu. Topi, Pauli kawuka kavaleka, kavatola pambali vanachuli vaki, pawombaneyi na vandu majuva vonda kubwalu ya mundu yumu litawa lyaki Tilanu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Milandu ayi yayendililili chipindi cha myaka mivili, hata Vayawudi na Vagiliki venikaya vonda va Asia valipikanishili chilongu cha Bambu.</para>
  <para style="s">Vana va Sikewa vakuyesha kuvinga finyamkela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Chapanga agolili mihilu mikomi kwa kupitila Pauli. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vandu yivavelili vatami vatolili fitambala na yingwa sha chichuku sha Pauli vavayeghela vatami vawu pavagufyili matami vawu vawukili na finyamkela vavafuma. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vayawudi vamu yivavinga finyamkela vayelijili aku na aku pavayesha kutambula litawa lya Bambu Yesu kwa vala yivavelili na finyamkela, pavadeta, “Nguvawombela kwa litawa lya Yesu, yula Pauli yamlandula.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vana saba va Sikewa, Mtambika mkomi wa Vayawudi, vavelili vamu wa vala yivagola nawula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini chinyamkela avayangulili, “Ndimumanya Yesu wuwowu ndimumanya Pauli, lakini yumwi mwavaghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pambeli yula mundu yaveli na chinyamkela kavajumbila nongwa avasidili liwovi. Na vala vana va Sikewa vatuvili kufuma nyumba yila chipula na vamema mivanga mumuvili yawu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kila mundu wa aku Ifesu, Muyawudi na Mugiliki vapikanishili filongu afi. Vonda valwangili, valijumilili litawa lya Bambu Yesu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vala yivajumilili Bambu vayihasha pamu, kudeta kwa vandu milandu yivagolili. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vamonga yivagolili milandu ya uhavi, vakungashili fitabu fyawu, vafinyanya motu, vandu vonda vafiwona. Kwa kukasha vaveli fikulinganila na mbiya migwala alufu milongu muhanu ya mbiya sha Malekani. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwa ndambu ayi chilongu cha Bambu lyakwilili kosi na kuva na liwovi nendu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndilingu aku Ifesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Milandu ayi payipelili, Pauli alamulili kuyenda Yelusalemu kupitila Makedoniya na Akaya. Paghaveyi munjila adetili mundima yaki, “Pandiva kula, danyendi Loma.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kavalayisha vandu vavili vatangi vaki, veni vaveli Timotewu na Ilastu, vamlonguleli kuyenda Makedoniya na mweni asighalili Asia chipindi chitali.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Chipindi achi kwafumbukili ndilingu ngomi aku Ifesu kwanongwa ya deha ya Bambu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwaveli na mponda mbiya vamkemaya Demetiliu, mweni aveli na chichuku cha kusongola ming'omung'omu ya nyumba ya mlungu mdadala vamkemaya Alitemi. Mafundi vaki vamgolilili chichuku chapatili mbiya sitangalili. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Demetiliu kavakungula ava pamu na vamonga vavelili na chichuku chichila, kadeta, “Yumwi valulumi, mumanya kucha ulundamali wa yufwi ukufuma muchichuku achi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ponopa mukulola na kupikanisha mwaveni milandu yagolili Pauli apa Ifesu hela ha, ila kosi Asia. Mweni kavagola vandu vaghalambuki na kujumila kucha milungu ayi yivagolili na vandu, ndi milungu ng'odu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>chichuku achi dachivi na litawa livipili. Ila chindu achi dachigoleki munyumba ya mlungu yivamkemaya mdala yaveli mkomi Alitemi, davalangiwi kucha chindu ha. Pambeli jumu shaki ayu sivelili Asia yonda na mlima wonda dasipeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pavapikanishili afi vakalala, vavika umatu, pavadeta, “Mkomi Alitemi wa Vaifesu!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mbwani yosi yamemili ndilingu, vatuva mbilu vayingila pavadingila, chipindi achi vavakang'ala Gayu na Alisitaku, venikaya va Makedoniya vaveli mumwanja pamu na Pauli. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pauli padayileyi kuyingila pagati ya vandu, vanachuli vaki vamukanisha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vakomi vamonga va Asia, vavelili vaghanja vaki, vavalayisha vandu vaki, pavamluva akotoo kuyenda kula kuvadingila misambu, dayivi ngondu kwa mweni. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Chipindechi, vakawuteyi vamonga vavelili vakudeta chindu achi na vamonga chindu chila, yavelili ndilingu, mbaka lila likungashu lyatilingikili, mbaka vamonga vamanyila ha nongwa liki vayikungashili pamu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Topi Vayawudi vamugolili Alekisanda ayilangushi paulongolu, vandu vamu vayiholili ndi mweni. Topi Alekisanda kavapungila vandu liwoku, akadayileyi kuyitasha paulongolu ya lipinga lya vandu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lakini pavamanyili mweni ndi Muyawudi, vonda vawutila pamu kwa lishu limu, “Mkomi Alitemi wa Vaifesu!” Vayendelela kuwuta nawula masaa mavili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pambeli ndumindumi wa mbwani yila aweshili kuvagola vanyamali. Kavawombela, “Kila mundu wa Ifesu, kamanya kucha mweni ndi mdimi wa Vaifesu nyumba ya mlungu yivamkema Alitemi na mdimi wa lila ling'omung'omu liponikili kufuma kumbindi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yalema milandu ayi. Topi munyamali, mukotoo kugola chindu chochosi ngajila kuyivavala. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Muvayegha vandu ava, vangajila kuhija findu fya nyumba ngomi ya mlungu wetu mdadala awu kumjowola. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Payiva Demetiliu na vagolafichuku vaki mani vana nongwa na vandu ava, kuchiveli chitemela na kwaveli vakomi va milima, vakuwesha kuvahigha. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kucha muna milandu yingi, muyiyeghi kuchitemela cha milandu kucha ayi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwa findu figolikili nalelu, tungaweshili kuhighiwa kwanongwa tuyegha ndilingu. Kandi tuvahela cha kudeta nongwa liki tugola ndilingu mulipinga ali.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Padetili kala fila, kamalila likungashu.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuyenda kandi Makedoniya na Ugiliki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Milandu yila payipelili, Pauli avakemili pamu vala vanachuli, avakuvilishili kunda. Pambeli kavayitawula kawuka kayenda mbaka Makedoniya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Apitili milima yila akavakuvilisheyi ndima vandu kwa filongu fitangalili. Pambeli afikili Ugiliki. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kweni ayikalili myesi mitatu. Payitandeyi mwanja wa Siliya, awonili kucha Vayawudi vavelili vakudayila kumgolela findu fya wafu, awonili awuyi kwa kupitila Makedoniya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vandu ava vavelili vamkovekelili Pauli, Sopatu mwana wa Pilu kufuma Beleya na Alisitaku na Sekundusi na vandu va Tesaloniki na Gayu mundu wa Delibe na Timotewu pamu na Tukiku na Tilofimu vandu kufuma Asia. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ila vandu vala vamlongulela kala vakamuvetileyi Tiloa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yufwi palipitili lijuva lya mibumunda yingajila simika, twayipakilili muwatu kufuma Filipi na mulijuva lya muhanu twafikili Tiloa. Aku twayikalili lijuma limu.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli mwanja wa mwishu kwa vandu va Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lijuva lya kupumulila palumii vatanganikili kulya mibumunda yingajila kutayiwa simika, Pauli kayangwa na vandu mbaka pamandandu, kwanongwa akayilateyi kuwuka chilawu yaki. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Chumbagati mutuvelili chaveli kumbindi, kwavelili niku sitangalili sikayakeyi pala patutang'anikeyi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Chijana yumu litawa lyaki Eutuku avelili kayikala padilisha chipindi Pauli akuyendelela kulandula. Eutuku akandili kusisila padokwa padokwa mbaka mbota simukamula, awili pasi kufuma kumbindi golofwa ya tatu. Vamusola asovili kala. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pauli asunukili pasi, kagondama, kamukusikila na kudeta, “Mkotoo kuyipwelesha nongwa akali na unofu mugati yaki.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pambeli kakwela kandi kumbindi, kaketula libumunda, kalya. Kayendelela kulandula mbaka linyagogolu, pambeli kawuka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vala vandu vamtolili yula msongolu mbaka kayaki aveli mnofu nakaka, vandu vadowoka dohoo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja kufuma Tiloa kuyenda Miletu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yufwi twayipakilili muwatu twalongulili kuyenda Asu, kula tungamtolili Pauli, ndambu yalamulili mweni akadayileyi kufika kula kupitila kumlima. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Topi, tutang'aniki nayu kula Asu, tumpakila muwatu, tuyenda Mituleni. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kufuma aku twafikili Chiu chilawu yaki. Lijuva lya pili, twawolukili Samu na chilawu yaki twafikili Miletu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pauli avelili kayilata kuyendelela na mwanja kwa watu ngajila kupitila Ifesu ili akotoo kukelwa nendu aku Asia. Avelili akulopukesha kucha angaweshili kufika Yelusalemu kwa lihungu lya Pendikosti kucha yingaweshili.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuvayitawula vavaha wa Ifesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kufuma Miletu Pauli alayishili unjagila kwa vavaha va lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu va Ifesu vatanganiki na mweni. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pavafikili vavaha avawombilili, “Mumanya ndambu yindiyikalili na yumwi majuva vosi kukandila lijuva lila lya kwaa pafikili mkowa wa Asia. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mumanya ndambu yindimkimbanikilili Bambu kwa chigoyi chosi. Navelili muchipindi chidindalili kwa milandu ya ufyangu yivagolilili Vayawudi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ndaweshili ng'odu kuyilyepa kuvalandulila chilongu chochosi cha kuvatanga, kuvalandulila pawelu na kaya shenu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ndivagayila unjagila Vayawudi na Vagiliki vapomeli sambi kwa Chapanga na kumjumila Bambu wetu Yesu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ponopa muloli, kunu pandimjumila Mfuki Mng'alili, ndiva mumwanja kuyenda Yelusalemu, manya ng'odu milandu dandang'aniki nayu kula. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ila manya kucha Mfuki Mng'alili akungayika nenga mukila mbwani, kucha kuwopiwa na tabu fikumetela. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lakini nenga chindu ha, ngiba goli chila chichuku chanyimbili Bambu Yesu malili nanduli milandu ya nyanyi ya usangi wa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Napitili kwa vayenu vamonga, vosi ndivalandulila wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Lakini ponopa manya kwahela hata mundu yumu dang'oni kandi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Topi nalelu nguvawombela kucha payaghamila muyenu yumu, mani mwaveni. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nongwa ngangajila hata padokwa ha kuvawombela fyosi fyayilata Chapanga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mwivavali, mulidimi lipinga lila Mfuki Mng'alili lyavavikili yumwi muvi vadimi vaki. Mulidimi lipinga lya vandu yivamjumilili Kilistu, Chapanga avapatili kwa mwasi wa mwana mundu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Manya finofu munu kucha pambeli pang'uka nenga fingekembi vakali davavayanangi na davavi na lusungu ha na lipinga ali. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hata vayenu vamu davafumbuki vandu davadeti milandu ya ufyangu ili kuvayaghamisha vandundami na kuvagola vavakovikeli veni hela. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mloleyi kunu pamukumbuka kucha chipindi cha myaka mitatu majuva vosi ngutofya ha kuvakayika mwavosi kunu panila misosi pwaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Topi, ponopa nguvavika mumawoku va Chapanga na kwa chilongu chaki cha usangi, mweni akuwesha kuvagola na kuvagayila mbala pamu na vala vonda yivaveli vaki. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nenga ndavelili na luhujulu ha lwa mbiya na chumang'andu, wala yingwa sha mundu yoyonda. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yumwi mwaveni mumanya kucha gola chichuku kwa mawoku vangu ndimweni kuyipatila findu fyangu pamu na vayangu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kwa milandu yosi ndivalangusha kwa ngimbaniku ngomi na mukuwesha kuvatanga vasosuvafu na kukotoka kuyivasuwa filongu fya Bambu Yesu, ndambu yadetili, ‘Ngiba kutawula pitu kupokela.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pamalili kudeta afi katundama kadadava pamu na vosi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vosi valila, vamkusikila Pauli na kamkola liwoku kumunonela. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Vapatili lung'ong'u nesu kwa chilongu chavadetilili kucha davamuwoni kandi ha. Topi, vamyegha mbaka kuwatu.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuyenda Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Patuyitawulili kala, twayipakili muwatu tuyenda mbaka Kosi. Chilawu yaki twafikili Lodi, kufuma aku twayendili mbaka Patala. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kula twawuwonili watu wuvelili wukuyenda Foiniki, twipaka tuyenda. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pambeli twafikili mahali paveli tukuwesha kuyiwona Kupilu, twapitilili kundamba yaki tulongosha kuchanya ya Siliya. Twawolukili mbwani ya Tilu vasunushi misiwu yivelili muwatu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kula tuvawona vandundami, tuyikala nawu majuva saba, veni vamuwombela Pauli kwa liwovi lya Mfuki Mng'alili akotoo kuyipakila kuyenda Yelusalemu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mbaka majuva vala pavafikili, twawukili na vandu vonda pamu na vadala vawu na vana vawu vatupelikeshili mbaka panji ya mbwani, tutundama muluwongu lwa bahali tudadava kwa Chapanga. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Patuyitawulili nawu, tuyipakila muwatu, veni vawuya kayawu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yufwi twayendili Tilu mbaka Tolemaisi pala twavajambushili Vakilistu vayetu, twayikalili na veni lijuva limu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki tuwuka tuyenda Kayisalia. Kula twayendili kayaki Filipu mulandula wa Chilongu cha Nyanyi. Mweni aveli yumu wa vala saba yivashawuliwili kula kukanisa lya vandu va Yelusalemu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Avelili na vana vadala mchechi yivavelili vakalihela kuhetiwa veni vavelili na chichuku cha kulandula unjagila wa Chapanga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi, twavelili tuyikala kula majuva vatangalili, mbuyi yumu litawa lyaki Agabasi afikili kufuma Yudeya. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Atuyisilili katola lufunga lwa muchiwunu cha Pauli, kayikonga mawoku na mawulu, kadeta, “Mfuki Mng'alili kadeta naha, ‘Vayawudi kula Yelusalemu davamuwopi nahawu mundu yavelili na lufunga alu na damuhadiki kwa vangutungu va Vayawudi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi patupikanishili afi, yufwi na vandu yivavelili mahali pala, twamuwombili Pauli akotoo kuyenda Yelusalemu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini Pauli ayangulili, “Mukudayila kugola liki? Mukudayila kubalula mutwi nenga kwa misosi? Ndiva kala kuwopiwa muchijaka kula Yelusalemu weka hela ha, ila hata kusova kwanongwa ya Bambu Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Patulemwili kumudedeka twanyamalili, twadetili hela, “Chadayilili Bambu chigoleki!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Patuyikalili pala padokwa, twawopili misiwu ya mwanja, tuyendelela Yelusalemu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vala vandundami vamonga va Kayisalia vayendili pamu na yufwi, vatuyegha kaya ya Mnasoni twavelili tukuyenda kuyikala pamu na mweni kwa chipindi. Mnasoni avelili mwenikaya wa Kupilu, avelili mkilistu kwa majuva vatangalili.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuyenda kumjambusha Yakobi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Patufikili Yelusalemu, Vakilistu kula vatuyangili nyanyi nendu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki Pauli ayendili pamu na yufwi kumjambusha Yakobi na wuwowu vavaha vonda va vala Vakilistu yivavelili pamu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pambeli pavajambushili kala, Pauli avagotulilili milandu yosi yagolili Chapanga kwa vangutungu va Vayawudi kupitila undumindumi waki. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pavapikanishili afi, vamjumila Chapanga, pambeli vamuwombela Pauli, “Mlongu, ukuwesha kuvawona Vayawudi Vakilistu ngenju ngenju vonda vana weyi nendu kwanongwa ya Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Veni vahimuliwa milandu yaku, kucha ukuvalagha Vayawudi vosi mumilima kumleka Musa, kuvawombela vakotoo kuvagola jandu vana vawu, wala kukovikela milandu yivashovililili. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Tugoli liki ponopa? Nakaka veni vapikanila kala kucha yuwi kwisa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Topi, goli ngimu yitukuwombela. Kuvaveli vandu mchechi yivavikili lilaghanu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wilumbi pamu na veni mudadawu ya kuying'alisha, kuhomba mbiya sidayiliwa, pambeli wuvamoghi fwili shawu. Topi vandu vonda davamanyi kucha filongu fila fivawombiliwili fiyilatili yuwi fyahela mana yoyonda na kucha umweni baha ukuyikala ngimu shaliya ya Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa wuvadeta. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lakini kwa milandu ya vandu va milima yosi yivamjumilili Kilistu tuvayandikila kala baluwa na highilu yetu, vakotoo kulya findu fyavatambikili ming'omung'omu ya kusongola na vakotoo kulanda mwasi na vakotoo kulya fibudu na vakotoo kugola uwoni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki Pauli avatolili vala vandu kagola dadava ya kwing'alisha pamu na veni. Pambeli kayingila Munyumba ya Chapanga kuvawombela kucha ndili dayivi mwishu wa kuying'alisha pamu na veni na matambiku davagoli kwa vandu vosi vala.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akukamuliwa munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Chipindi cha majuva saba pavaveghi samba vapela, Vayawudi yivavelili vakufuma mlima wa Asia vamuwonili Pauli munyumba ya Chapanga, vavatumishili lipinga lya vandu lyosi vawoni maya, vamukamula. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vawutili, “Yumwi valulumi Vayisilaeli! Mututangi. Mundu ayu yavawula vandu vosi kila mahali milandu yingajila kulinganila na mlima wetu na Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa na nyumba ayi ya Chapanga. Kandi, pawileka ayi, kavayingisha Vagiliki munyumba ya Chapanga, kapapighasha mahali apa pang'alili.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vadetili naha nongwa vavelili vamuwona Tilofimu, Muifesu pamu na mweni kumbwani, vakacheyi Pauli kamuyingisha Munyumba ya Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kumbwani kosi kwakwilili ndilingu, vandu vayisili mbembu shonda, vamkamula Pauli, vamukukusha vamfumisha panji ya nyumba ya kudadavila na bahala pala milyangu ya nyumba ya kudadavila yitatiwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vayitandili kala kudayila kumuwulagha Pauli, lakini filongu fyamufikilili mkomi wa machonda wa Chilumi kucha Yelusalemu yosi yaveli yikwila ndilingu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kavatola machonda na vakomi vawu, kavayendela mbilu. Veni pavamuwonili mkomi va machonda na vamachonda vamleka Pauli kumtovanga. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pambeli mkomi wa machonda kaselela, kamkamula, kalayisha awopiwi kwa mingongola mivili, kadasha, “Ayu ghani? Na kagola chindu liki?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Vamonga mulipinga lila vakawuteyi vakadeteyi naha na vamonga naha. Mkomi wa machonda kalemwa kupata milandu ya nakaka kwanongwa ya umatu wula, kavalayisha vamuyeghi mugati ya luviwu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pauli pafikili mufikwelelu, machonda vawonili ngiba vamupapi kwanongwa ya ndilingu ya vandu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nongwa lipinga likomi lya vandu vamkovikelili na kuwuta, “Mumuwulayi!”</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akwitasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pavamuyingisheyi muluviwu, Pauli aluvili kwa mkomi wa machonda padeta, “Nguwesha kukuwombela chindu?” Yula mkomi wa machonda kayangula, “Kumbi ukuwesha kuywanga Chigiliki! <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yuwi yula Mumisili ndaa mwandi apa akandili ndilingu na kuvalongosha vatovilela elufu mchechi mbaka kucheja ng'odu!” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Pauli kayangula, “Nenga Muyawudi, ng'onekela Talisu kula Kilikiya, nenga mundu wa mbwani yimanyikili. Deku deku, ujumishi nywangi na vandu.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yula mkomi wa machonda kamjumisha. Pauli kawoloka muchikwenelu kavapungila liwoku vala vandu, pavanyamalili, akandili kuywanga nawu Chibulaniya.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pauli adetili, “Yumwi valulumi, valongu vangu na vatati vangu, mumbikanishi, nguyitasha kwa yumwi ponopa.” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pavapikanishili kucha akudeta nawu Chibulaniya vayendelela kunyamala. Pambeli kadeta,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Nenga mundu wa Vayawudi, ng'onikela aku Talisu mbwani ya Kilikiya, ila ngulila mbwani ayi, mumawulu va Gamalieli, vamanyili nyanyi Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa na va vambuyi vetu, ndayitawulili kwa ndima kwa Chapanga kucha yumwi vonda wumuvelili nalelu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ndivagobola na kuvawulagha vandu yivakovikeleyi njila ayi. Ndavakamulili valulumi na vadadala na kuvataya muchijaka. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mtambika mkomi na vavaha va chitemela vosi vakutovilela chilongu achi. Veni vanyimbili baluwa vavayandikilili vala valongu vangu Vayawudi vavelili kula Damasku. Nyenda Damasku ili ndivakamuli vandu ava na kuvayegha mbaka Yelusalemu kunu vawopiwa ili vapati asabu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akudeta ndambu walowukili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 9:1-19, 26:12-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Topi, pamelili mudeha pabehi ya Damasku, pamusi saa sita, ngesha ngomi kufuma kumbindi tepu yifumbuka yilangasha mbembu shosi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ndiva pasi, mbikanisha lishu paling'ombela, ‘Sauli Sauli! Wuli mbona ukugobola?’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nenga ndimudasha, ‘Bambu, yuwi ghani?’ Mweni kayangula. ‘Nenga Yesu wa Nasaleti. Ndi yiwugobola.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vala vayangu yivawonili yila ngesha, lakini vapikanishili ha lishu lya yula yaywangeyi na nenga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi, nenga ndimudasha, ‘Goli liki Bambu?’ Mweni Bambu kang'ombela, ‘Woloki, yendi Damasku na aku davakuwombeli fyosi fiwudayiliwa kugola.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ya yila ngesha yaveli ngomi nola kandi ha, vala vayangu vanongosha kwa kungamula liwoku mbaka fika Damasku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Kula kwaveli na mundu yumu vamkemaya Ananiasi, aveli mundu yamumanyili Chapanga, akombikeshagha Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa na atundamiwili na Vayawudi yivavelili vakwiyikala Damasku. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mweni ayisili kunola, kawoloka pabehi na nenga, kang'ombela, ‘Mlongu wangu Sauli! Loli kandi.’ Bahala pala nola kandi, ndimulola. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Anania kadeta, ‘Chapanga wa vambuyi vetu kakushawula yuwi ili umanyi chadayila na kumuwona yula goleki na kulipikanisha lishu lifuma mumlomu yaki. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nongwa dawuvi mtovilela waki kwa vandu vosi, kwa milandu ayi wuyiwonili na kupikanisha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Topi ponopa, ukuvetela liki? Woloki, ubatishiwi na uwushiwi sambi shaku na kulijumila litawa lyaki.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akukemiwa kuvalandulila vandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Pang'uyili kala Yelusalemu, padadaveyi munyumba ya Chapanga, ndalotili milotu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ndimuwona Chapanga, kang'ombela, ‘Lopukeshi wuki Yelusalemu, kwanongwa vandu va apa davajumili ng'odu pawuvatovilelili milandu ya nenga.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nenga nyangula, ‘Bambu, ava vamanya kucha nenga ndavawopili na kuvatovanga vala yivakujumilili na ndayingilaya munyumba sha kudadavila shosi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Na Stefwani mtovilela waku pawulayiwili, nenga ndavelili pabehi najumilili chilongu achi na kusidima yingwa shawu vala yivaveyi vakumuwulagha.’ <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mweni kang'ombela, ‘Yendi, nenga dandikulayishi uyendi kutali kwa vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vampikanisha chilongu chila mbaka padetili nawula, lakini vawuta pavadeta, “Mumuwulayi! Nongwa akujakwa ng'odu kunana.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vayendililili kudwelimuka kunu pavachihongwi chihongu mihabiti yawu na kutikula lifu kumbindi kwa maya, <verse number="24" style="v"/>yula mkomi wa machonda kalayisha vamuyeghi mugati ya luviwu lwa machonda, kadeta, mumulatuli ndomondu ili aweshi kumanya nongwa liki Vayawudi vakumuwutila. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pavamuwopili kala ili alatuliwi ndomondu, Pauli kamuwombela yula mkomi wa machonda yumu yawolukili pala, kadeta, “Wuli, Malawu vakujumisha kumulatula ndomondu mundu wa Loma ngajila kumuhigha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yula mkomi wa machonda papikanishili afi, kamuwombela mkomi wawu, padeta, “Ukudayila kugola liki? Mundu ayu mwenikaya wa Loma!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Topi, mkomi wa machonda kamuyendela Pauli kamdasha, “Ung'ombeli, yuwi mundu wa Loma?” Pauli kamyangula, “Yina.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mkomi wa machonda kadeta, “Nenga wuwowu ndiva mundu wa Loma kwa kuhomba mahombu makomi.” Pauli kadeta, “Lakini nenga mundu wa Loma kwa kuwoneka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vala vandu yivavelili kala kwa kumudodosha Pauli vawukili. Hata yula mkomi wa machonda atilili pamanyili Pauli mundu wa Loma avelili vamuwopa na mingongola.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli vamuyegha kuchitemela cha Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki, mkomi wa machonda akadayileyi kumanya vala Vayawudi chavadayileyi nakaka nongwa ya Pauli. Amuwoposolili Pauli lingongola, kalayisha vatambika vakomi na chitemela chosi vatang'ani. Pambeli kamuyegha Pauli, kamuwolosha pachitemela cha Vayawudi.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pauli akavaloleyi vala vaveli muchitemela, pambeli kakanda kudeta, “Valongu vangu, mbaka nalelu ndiyikala nyanyi ndambu yadayilili Chapanga.” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ananiasi mtambika mkomi kavalayisha vala yivawolukili pabehi yaki vamtovi mbandi mumlomu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi Pauli kamuwombela, “Chapanga dakutovi yuwi mfyangu. Yuwi ukwikala ili kuhigha kucha wuvadeta Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa, lakini yuwi ukulayisha vandovi ngajila kukombikesha Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vala yivawolukili pabehi vadetili, “Wuli! Yuwi wukumjohola mtambika mkomi wa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pauli kadeta, “Valongu vangu ngamanyeyi ha kucha mweni mtambika mkomi, nongwa yiyandikiwa, ‘Ukotoo kumdetela ufyangu mtavala wa vandu vaku.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pauli pamanyili kucha lipinga limonga lya Masadukayu na lya pili lya Vafwalisayu, adetili kwa lishu likomi mugati ya chila chitemela, “Valongu vangu, nenga Mfwalisayu mwana wa Vafwalisayu, nenga vanyegha kuchitemela kwanongwa ngushuvilila kucha yivasovili davashukuki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pamalili kudeta fila, pavelili malimbanu Vafwalisayu na Masadukayu, vavaghanika. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nongwa Masadukayu vakudetaya kucha kwahela kushukuka wala makungu wala mfuki, ila Vafwalisayu vakujumila findu fyosi fitatu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pavelili na umatu diki. Vawula va Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa wa Vafwalisayu vawoloka na kudeta fyavawonili veni kwahilu, pavadeta, “Tuwona ng'odu chavifyili mundu ayu. Ila payiva mfuki awu makungu kadeta nayu liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Valeva ndewu ngomi, yula mkomi wa machonda ayipwelishili Pauli davamsatangi, kalayisha machonda vasunuki vakamtoli na kumuwuyisha mugati ya luviwu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Payifikili pamii, Bambu awolukili pabehi ya Pauli, katovilela, “Ugangamali! Kuvawombela milandu yangu apa Yelusalemu na aku Loma dawugoli wuwowu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi vakugola milandu ya kumuwulagha Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki pamalavila, Vayawudi vatanganikili kwa lufisu. Vafingili, “Yufwi datuyikaji kulya na kulanda mbaka patumuwulayili kala Pauli.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vandu vayongishekili milongu mchechi ndi yivafinga kugola wula. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Veni vayenda kwa vatambika vakomi na vavaha, vadeta, “Tuyikaja kulya mbaka tumwulayi Pauli.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi, ponopa yumwi pamu na vavaha va chitemela mumuwombeli mkomi wa machonda amuyeghi pasi kwa yumwi, kucha mukudayila kumanya nendu milandu yaki na yufwi tuva kala kumuwulagha tanila ngajila kufika pabehi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mpwa mundu Pauli papikanishili filongu fila kayenda mugati ya luviwu, kamuwombela Pauli ndambu ya milandu ya vandu vadayilili kumuwulagha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi Pauli akemili machonda yumu, kamuwombela, “Umtoli mwananguta ayu umuyeghi kwa mkomi wa machonda, kana chindu cha kumuwombela.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Topi, machonda kamtola, kamyegha kwa mkomi wa machonda kamuwombela, “Pauli yula yawopiwili akangemili kanuva nguyegheli mwananguta ayu kwa yuwi kucha kana chindu cha kukuwombela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yula mkomi wa machonda kamkamula liwoku vayisegha pambali, kamdasha kwa lufisu, “Kuna chilongu liki ukudayila kung'ombela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kadeta, “Vayawudi vawombanila vakuluvi umuyeghi Pauli kuchitemela kunu pavayilyambishila kucha chitemela chikudayila kupata filongu fitangalili fimwilata mweni. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Topi, yuwi ukotoo kujumila, kwanongwa vandu milongu mchechi na vamonga vamufukila, vafingana vakotoo kulya wala kulanda mbaka pavamuwulaghili kala, ponopa veni vava kala, vakukuvetela yuwi dawulamuli liki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Topi yula mkomi wa machonda kamulayila akotoo kumuwombela mundu yoyosi kucha kanyeghela filongu afi, topi, kamuleka yula mwananguta ayendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuhamila kwa Kayisalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kavakema machonda vakomi vavili, kadeta, “Muvaviki ndemindemi vangandawu mya mbili vavi kala kuyenda Kayisalia na vangandawu yivakwela fwalasi milongu saba na va migoha mya mbili, vavi kala kuwuka kukali hela kufika saa tatu nalelu pamihi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mutandili fwalasi Pauli mumpaki na kumuyegha kungajila ndilingu kwa mkomi wa mkowa wa Yudeya yivamkema Filekisi.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pambeli mkomi wa machonda kayandika baluwa naha,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Nenga Kilawudia Lisia ngukuyandikila yuwi muhishimiwa Filekisi, mkomi wa mkowa wa Yudeya. Hasi mkomi! <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mundu ayu vamukamulili Vayawudi, avelili padokwa vamuwulaghi, topi nyenda pamu na machonda ndimulowola pambikanishili kucha mweni aveli mundu wa Loma. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nenga padayilili kumanya chindu liki chavadayileyi kumuhigha, nimusunusha na kumuvika pawulongolu ya chitemela. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ng'ona kavahela nongwa yoyonda vamuhigha kwa Malawu vawu hela, wala kwa hela filongu fingi fya kumugola awulayiwi awu kumutaya muchijaka. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pamanyili milandu ya kudayila kumuvikila ndilingu mundu ayu, tepu ndimuyegha kwa veni na nivalayila vala vamuhighili, vadeti milandu yaki kwa yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Topi, vala machonda vamutola Pauli kucha avalayilili, vamuyegha pamihi wuwula wula mbaka Ampatili. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pamalavila machonda va mawulu vavaleka vala yivayipaka fwalasi vayendi pamu na veni, veni vawuya kukambi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vala pavafikili Kayisalia, vamugayila bambu yila baluwa, vamuvika Pauli pawulongolu yaki. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mweni payisomili kala, kavadasha Pauli aveli mundu wa mlima liki? Pavamuwombilili kucha aveli mundu wa Kilikiya, <verse number="35" style="v"/>kadeta, “Dandikupikanishi yuwi pavayisa vala yivadayilili kukuhigha.” Kalayisha vamudimi Pauli munyumba ya mutwa Helodi.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nongwa ya kumuhigha Pauli kuchitemela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pavapitili majuva muhanu, mtambika mkomi Ananiasi, asunukili na vavaha vamonga pamu na mundu yavatanga vandu Malawu kuchitemela yivamukema Tetulu, veni vamuhimulilagha mkomi wa mkowa milandu ya Pauli. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pauli akemiwili na Tetulu akandili kumuhigha, adetili naha,</para>
  <para style="p">“Mkomi Filekisi, ulongoshi waku wa nyanyi wuyegha kusika nendu na magolikeshu va lasima vakugoliwa kwa unofu wa mlima wetu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi tukuchipokela chilongu achi kwa seku yonda na numbilu ngomi kwa yuwi Filekisi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lakini ngajila kutola chipindi chikomi munu, tukukuluva kwa usangi waku wutupikanishi padokwa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nongwa tumuwona mundu ayu kanyanyi ng'odu, mweni akukandishagha ndilingu gati ya Vayawudi kila mahali pamlimawu na wuwowu ndi mkomi wa chipinga cha Vanasaleti. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kandi kayesha kuyiduka nyumba ya Chapanga, yufwi tumukamula. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lakini Lisia mkomi wa machonda ayisili kumuwusha mumawoku vetu kwa liwovi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kavalayisha vala yivamuhighili vayisi kwa yuwi. Yuwi umdashi umweni dawupati milandu yosi yitumuhighila yufwi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vayawudi na veni vamuhighili, vadeta, fyosi afi fyaveli nakaka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akwitasha kwa Filekisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi mkomi Filekisi kamujumisha Pauli adeti. Na mweni Pauli adetili, “Ngusekilela kuyitasha kwa yuwi manya yuwi kucha muhigha wa mlima awu kwa myaka yitangalili. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ukuwesha kumanya vapita majuva lilongu na mavili hela ha, tangila nyendi Yelusalemu kumjuma Chapanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vayawudi vang'ona ng'odu pang'ombana na mundu yoyosi. Vang'onili ng'odu pandivatumishila vandu munyumba ya kudadavila, wala munyumba sha kudadavila shawu, wala mahali pengi mumbwanemu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wala vaweshi ng'odu kutovilela fyavahighila nenga. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Chijumila nenga kwa yuwi ndi achi: Nenga ngumujuma Chapanga wa vavaha vetu na nguyikala pangovikela deha yila veni vakwikema chipinga cha udesi. Ngufijumila filongu fyosi fyavayandikilili mufitabu fya Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa na vambuyi va Chapanga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nenga ngumshuvilila Chapanga na veni vakumshuvilila wuwu, kucha vandu goleki na vawafu, davashukuki. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Myanja yitangalili ngudayila kuva na ndima ya nyanyi kwa Chapanga na kwa vandu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Pandiyikalili kutali kwa myaka yimonga, ng'uya Yelusalemu kuvayeghela yumwi mwayangu utangi na kutawula litambiku. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Chipindi pagoleyi afi, ndi pavang'onili munyumba ya Chapanga, ndavelili pagolili kala yila dadavu ya kwing'alisha. Kwavelili kwahela lipinga lya vandu, wala ndilingu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini kwavelili Vayawudi vamonga kufuma Asia, ava vangavelili vavi apa kwa yuwi na kuyegha mahighu vawu mani leki vangavelili na chindu chochosi cha kudeta kwa nenga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Awu, wuvaleki ava yivavelili apa vadeti, chivawonili mifya chipindi pavang'olushili pachitemela chikomi, <verse number="21" style="v"/>ila deta filongu afi hela, pang'olukili pawulongolu yawu, ‘Nalelu mukuhigha kwanongwa ya kudeta kucha yivasovili davashukuki.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Filekisi mweni avelili kalimanya lipinga limkovikela Kilistu, asayikili filongu afi kavawombela, “Dahighi filongu afi chipindi Lisia mkomi wa machonda payisa apa.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pambeli kamulayila yula machonda yamuwopili Pauli muchijaka, ila vamupi upekesu padokwa na vaghanja vaki akotoo kuvakanisha kumuyeghela findu fyadayila.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli pawulongolu ya Filekisi na Dilusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pavapitili majuva madokwa, Filekisi ayisili pamu na mdamundu Dilusila mweni aveli Muyawudi. Alayishili vamuyeghi Pauli, amupikanishili padeteyi milandu ya kumujumila Yesu Kilistu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lakini Pauli pakandeyi kudeta filongu fyaki fya milandu ya usangi na kuyisikisha padokwa na kwilata lijuva Chapanga davahighi vandu, Filekisi alwangili kayangula, “Ponopa yendi, nenga dandikukemi kandi pambata fwasi.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Chipindi chichila chila akashuvilileyi kupata swinda kwa Pauli, kwanongwa ayi amukemili myanja yitangalili paywanga na mweni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Myaka mivili payipitili, Polikiu Festu atavalili kufuma Filekisi, aveli mkomi wa mkowa. Kwanongwa Filekisi adayilagha kuyiwongola kwa Vayawudi, amlekili Pauli mumula mula muchijaka.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuyegha filongu kwa mutwa wa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Majuva matatu pavafikili kumukova, Festu afumili Kayisalia kayenda Yelusalemu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi pamu na vakomi va Vayawudi vamuwombilili filongu fivamuhighilili Pauli, vamudedeka Festu, <verse number="3" style="v"/>na kumdedeka atutangi mundoyu, ayeghiwi Yelusalemu, valya swinda ili vamukamuli na kumuwulagha mudeha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lakini Festu kayangula kucha, “Pauli dasighali muchijaka kula Kayisalia na nenga samba nyenda aku majuva vavava. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Muvaleki vakomi venu vayendi aku pamu na nenga vakadeti fyavayihola kwa mundoyu leki kagola chindu chochosi cha wafu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Festu ayikalili na veni kwa majuva manani awu lilongu pambeli awuyili Kayisalia. Chilawu yaki ayendili kuchitemela, kalayisha Pauli ayeghiwi mugati ya chitemela. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Chipindi Pauli pafikeyi, Vayawudi vavelili vafika kufuma Yelusalemu vamushengitela na kudeta uhighi utangalili wutawukili wungajila kuva nakaka. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pauli adetili, “Nenga mifya chilongu cha Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa na va Vayawudi ha, wala cha nyumba ya kudadavila, wala cha Kayisali mutwa wa Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lakini Festu akadayileyi kuvatangila Vayawudi, kamuyangula Pauli kadeta, “Wuli, ukudayila kuyenda Yelusalemu, vakakuhighi kula kunu panukulola kwanongwa ya filongu afi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pauli kadeta, “Nenga nguwoloka apa pawulongolu ya chitemela cha mutwa wa Loma, apa pandiyilatili kuhighiwa, kucha yuwi yiwumanyili nendu nenga mifya chilongu cha Vayawudi ng'odu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi payiva mifya Malawu, awu gola chindu cha kuhighiwa njifwa, nguluva ha kupomiliwa, ila kucha chindu chavahighila cha nakaka ng'odu, kwahela mundu yawesha kungamula. Ngiba ngahighiwi kuchitemela cha mutwa wa Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi, Festu pamalilili kudeta na mundu va chitemela, kayangula, leki kudayila kuyenda kwa Kayisali! Topi dawuyendi kwa Kayisali.</para>
  <para style="s">Festu akumuwombela Agilipa milandu ya Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Majuva vamu pavapitili kala, mutwa Agilipa na Beliniki vafikili Kayisalia, kumjambusha Festu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na pavayikalili kula majuva vatangalili, Festu kamuhimulila mutwa filongu fya Pauli, kadeta, “Kuna mundu yumu yalekiwili na Filekisi muchijaka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Panyendili Yelusalemu vatambika vakomi na vavaha va Vayawudi vang'ombela milandu yaki, vakadayileyi ndimuhighi njifwa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lakini nenga ndavayangulili kucha chishovi cha vandu va Loma ha kumtawula ngajila kuhighiwa na vahighi vaki nju na kupata fwasi ya kuyitasha kwilata highu asi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi pavatang'anikili apa meta ha, ila lijuva lya pili ndiyikala muchigoda cha chitemela ndivalayisha vamuyeghi mundu yula. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na vala yivamuhighili pavawolukili vayegha filongu fingi fya wafu ha, kucha wundiyiholeyi, <verse number="19" style="v"/>ila vavelili na minasha yitangalili yiilatili dadavilu yawu veni hela na milandu ya mundu yumu yakemiwa Yesu, yavelili kasova kala, lakini Pauli akamalili kudeta kucha munofu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nenga manya ha kucha ningapatili wuliwuli unakaka wa nongwa ayi, ndimudasha Pauli leki akudayila kuyenda Yelusalemu vakamuhighili aku filongu afi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lakini Pauli akaluveyi vakamuhighili kwa Kayisali, ndivalayila vamudimi mbaka pandimuyegha kwa mutwa wa Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Agilipa kamuwombela Festu, “Nenga ngadayileyi wuwowu kumupikanisha mundu ayu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Festu kayangula, “Dawumpikanishi chilawu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pamalavila Agilipa kayisa pamu na Beliniki pavayijuma na filumbi, vayingila pachitemela, pamu na machonda vakomi na vandu vakomi va mumbwani, Festu kalayila vakamuyeghi Pauli. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Festu kadeta, “Mutwa Agilipa na mwavosi yimuvelili pamu na yufwi, mumuwona mundu ayu, vandu va Wuyawudi vosi na aku Yelusalemu na apa wuwowu vadayila ndivatangi, vakawuteyi kucha akotoo kunana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lakini nenga ngawoneyi kucha kagola chilongu cha kumugola ahighiwi njifwa ha na mweni padayileyi akamuhighi mutwa wa Loma, ngalamulili kumuyegha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lakini bambu, nenga milandu yaki ndiva hela chilongu nakaka cha kumuyandikila. Topi, ndimuyegha pawulongolu yenu, kwa yuwi mutwa Agilipa, pawumudasha pambeli dambati chilongu cha kuyandika. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwanongwa nguwona kwahela chindu cha mana kumuyegha muwopi ngajila kudeta nakaka chavifyili kwa mutwa wa Loma.”</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli kayitasha mweni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Agilipa kamuwombela Pauli, “Ukuwesha kudeta filongu fyaku.” Apa Pauli awolushili liwoku lyaki kumbindi na kukanda kudeta,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Nguyiwona ngiba ndima yipwisuka, yuwi mutwa Agilipa nalelu nguhimula pawulongolu yaku, milandu yosi yivahighila Vayawudi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ayi yuwi kumanya nendu chishovi cha Vayawudi na malimbanu vawu, ponopa ngukuluva wuyiwunishili umbikanishi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Nongwa Vayawudi vosi vamanya ngalilu yangu tangila usongolu wangu, yavelili tangila pa kwandi kumlima wangu na aku Yelusalemu, <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vamanyili nendu kukandila dahili na vakuwesha kutovilela, kucha ndaveli pakwandi ndayikalili kucha yumu wa chipinga chivelili na ujumilwa mkomi muujumilwa wetu, ndi chipinga cha Vafwalisayu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na ponopa nguwoloka apa highiwi kwanongwa ya kushuvilila jangi yavavapili vambuyi vetu vapatili kwa Chapanga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sheni siva jangi kwa makabila vetu lilongu na mbili vakulembelela kuyifikila, pavamujuma Chapanga nendu majuva vosi. Yuwi mutwa nenga dahighiwi na Vayawudi kwanongwa ya shuvililu ali! <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yumwi yimuvelili apa nongwa liki mukuyihola yidindala kucha Chapanga akuvashukusha yivasovili?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Nakaka ndimweni ndiyiwona mundima yangu kucha gola findu fitangalili kulimba litawa lya Yesu wa Nasaleti. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Filongu afi ndi figolili aku Yelusalemu. Nengapa weka ndi yimbatili uwesu kwa vatambika vakomi, ili ndivawopi muchijaka vandu vatangalili va Chapanga na veni vahighiwili kuwulaghiwa, ndagolili doo ya kujumila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Myanja yitangalili munyumba ya kudadavila shosi ndivalatula vandu na kuvang'ang'anika kumjowola Chapanga, ndivakalalila kucha ndaveli na lukwali, ndayigolili mkali hata mumbwani sha kuuhenja.”</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuhimulila palowukili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Topi, pandiveyi muchichuku ayi ngayendeyi Damasku, ndavelili na liwovi likomi vangayilili vatambika vakomi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yuwi mutwa, pamelili mudeha yaveli lijuva lwa palundosi ng'ona ngesha kufuma kumbindi yapitili ngesha ya lijuva, yikamulikeyi nenga, pamu na vala yimelili nawu mbembu shosi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Twawili pasi twavosi, mbikanisha lishu likudeta na nenga kwa Chibulaniya, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Nongwa liki ukugobola? Ukugobola kucha senga yadangula na liwulu lukweku lwa bambu waki.’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nenga dasha, ‘Bambu yuwi ghani?’ Na mweni Bambu kayangula, ‘Nenga Yesu, yiundesha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Topi chindu ha, ponopa tandamuki, woloki. Ndikufumbukila ili ndikugoli ndumindumi wangu na mtovileli. Dawuvawombeli vandu vamonga milandu yiwuyiwonili nalelu na yila yivelili yakali dandikulangushi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Dandikulowoshi kwa vandu va Isilaeli pamu na vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi ngukulayishila kwa veni ponopa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Dawuvapwembuli mesu vawu na kuvagola vafumi mulwisa na kuyingila mungesha, vafumi muliwovi lya Lijangavandu na kumughalambukila Chapanga. Kwa ujumilwa wawu davaweshi kupomeliwa sambi shawu na kutola mahali pawu gati ya vala yivajumilili.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuhimulila undumindumi waki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Mutwa Agilipa, topi nenga nemwa kuva na makuluhu kwa fila finangushiwili kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ila ndakandili kulandula kwa vandu va Damasku, pambeli kwa vala va Yelusalemu na mlima wosi wa Yudeya, kandi nyenda kwa vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi. Ndivalayila vamughalambukili Chapanga na kulangusha kucha vapomela. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ayi Vayawudi vangamulili mugati ya nyumba ya Chapanga na vayeshili kung'ulaya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Topi Chapanga kandanga, mbaka nalelu ng'oloka uswanu nguvatovilela vosi vakomi na vadokwa. Fila fing'omba nenga ndi fila vambuyi va Chapanga na Musa vawombili dafiwoneki. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vadeta Kilistu agobuleki na mweni ghavi wa kwaa kushukuka munjifwa, ili alanduli kucha lwengi lwa ukombola lukuvang'alikila Vayawudi na vandu vangajila Vayawudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pauli pafikili apa mukuyitasha kwaki, Festu kalakala, “Pauli! Kuna lukwali! Kusoma koseku, kukutaya lukwali!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lakini Pauli kadeta, “Mkomi Festu, Ndiva na lukwali ha. Ching'omba nenga chiva nakaka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yuwi mutwa Agilipa kumanya milandu ayi, nongwa nguwesha kudeta ngajila lyova paulongolu yaku. Ndivahela lyogha kucha filongu afi fimanyika kwa yuwi nongwa chindu achi chigoleka pachifisu ha. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mutwa Agilipa, wuli! Ukuvajumila vambuyi? Manya kucha yuwi ukuvajumila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Agilipa kamuyangula Pauli, “Ukwihola kucha kwa chipindi chidokwa hela dawugoli ndivi Mundu yindimjumilili Kilistu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pauli kamuyangula, “Ngumuluva Chapanga kwa chipindi chidokwa awu chitali, yuwi weka hela ha, ila kwa vosi yivambikanisha nalelu vavi kucha nenga lakini ngajila mingongola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mutwa Agilipa, mkomi wa mkoa, Beliniki na vala yivavelili pamu na mweni vawolukili. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pavawukili pala Agilipa na Festu vawombana, “Mundu ayu kagola chindu ha chimudayila kupata asabu ya kuwulayiwa awu kuwopiwa.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Agilipa awombili na Festu, mundu ayu angaweshili kulekisheliwa, leki angadayilili ng'odu kuyenda kwa Kayisali.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuyenda Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pavalamulili kuyenda mbaka Italiya, vamuvikili Pauli pamu na vandu vawopiwili pasi ya udimi wa Yuliu yavelili mkomi wa machonda, vavakemili, “Chipinga cha mutwa wa Loma.” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Twayipakili watu wa Adilamitu wuvelili na mwanja wa kupitila kambi singi sha mkoa wa Asia, twakandili mwanja. Alisitaku, mwenikaya wa Makedoniya kufuma Tesaloniki, aveli pamu na yufwi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki twafikili Sidoni. Yuliu amutangili nendu Pauli amujumishili kuyenda kuvalola vaghanja vaki, apati chadayilili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kufuma aku twapitili mumbalimbali ya Kupilu, kwanongwa liyegha lyatulimbili kuulongolu yetu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pambeli twajabukili bahali ya Kilikiya na Pamfilia, tuwoloka Mila, mbwani ya Lukia. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apa yula machonda awonili watu wumu wa Alekisandilia uvelili ukuyenda Italiya, atupakilili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Twayendili mwanja mbolimboli kwa majuva vatangalili na yaveli mujibu kufika pabehi ya Nidu. Kwanongwa liyegha lyaveli likomi likutulimba, tuyenda ngajila kuwoloka tupitila mbembu ya Kileti pabehi ya kambi ya Salumoni, kweni kwaveli na liyegha lidokwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Twapitili mumbalimbali yaki kwa kudomba twafikili mahali pakemiwa “Kambi ya nyanyi,” pabehi ya mbwani ya Lesea.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Chipindi chitali twayikalili pala na mwanja waveli mnofu ha kwanongwa yavelili yidindala kutyanga na watu, lijuva lya kuyikaja kulya lyaveli lipita kala, Pauli avadindashili ndima, <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Mwavabambu, nguwona kucha mwanja awu dawuvi mnofu ha na misiwu dayidanganyiki pamu na watu hela ha, ila wuwowu hata yufwi tuva munjifwa.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini yula ofisa kampikana munu msola watu na muna watu pitu kumpikana Pauli. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na kwanongwa kambi yila yaveli nofu ha kuyikala chipindi chila cha lupepu, vandu vatangalili valuvili kuyendilela na mwanja, payiweshikana yifiki Foniki. Kucha pavawesha vafiki kambi ya Kileti na vayikali aku chipindi cha lupepu, yavelili mbembu ya Ughanji uhehi na Kuchanya uhehi.</para>
  <para style="s">Liwumbula likomi mubahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi, liyegha lidokwa kufuma kuvaghanji vakandili kupugha, veni vakacheyi chavayilateyi dachigoleki, vawopola watu vakanda mwanja vayenda mbaka pabehi ya Kileti. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tepu liyisa lingukumbi kufuma mwambu wa kundamba ya wuyighanji kuyenda kubahali, vakulikema “Liyegha lya ughanji.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Watu wabotiwili na lingukumbi na pawuweshili ngo'du kulimba, twawulekili usukumuliwi na lingukumbi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tulopukesha kupita pabehi na liwunguli lidokwa livalikema Kawuda, tuyesha kuukwegha watu wuvelili muwatu mkomi kwa kudomba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pavaweshili kala, vayitanga kuuwopa watu kwa nyombu muwatu mkomi, veni vakatileyi kugwama mungema, veni vakukema, “Silati” vajabula midengi na vawuleka wula watu wuyendi na liwumbula. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nongwa lila liwumbula lyavelili likutulimba nendu, lijuva lya pili vakanda kudanga misiwu yimonga mubahali. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lijuva lya tatu vadanga findu fya muwatu kwa mawoku vawu veni. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lijuva wala ndondwa shawonikili ng'odu kwa chipindi cha majuva vatangalili na liwumbula likomi litulimba, topi, tukashuvilileyi kandi ha kulowuliwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vavelili vayikala chipindi chitali ngajila kulya filivi, Pauli awolukili pagati yawu, kadeta, “Mwabambu, mungambikanishili nenga tungawukili ha kula Kileti na kupata tabu ayi na asala ayi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ponopa nguvawombela, muvi na ndima ngomi, nongwa kwahela hata mundu yumu gati ya yumwi dasovi, ila watu weka yaki dawuyaghamili. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lichu pamihi abwitukilili makungu wa Chapanga. Chapanga yula yavelili nenga mundu waki, ndi mweni yindimkimbanikila awolukili pabehi na nenga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Makungu kang'ombela, ‘Kotoo kutila Pauli, dawuyendi kuwoloka kwa Mutwa wa Loma, loli, Chapanga davakugayili vandu vonda yivaveli muwatu kwanongwa ya yuwi.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Topi, yumwi mwavabambu, mukotoo kuyipwelesha, kwanongwa ngumujumila Chapanga, kucha dayivi wuwula kucha wang'ombilili. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lakini datudangiwi muluwongu lwa liwunguli limoli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pamihi lijuva lya lilongu na mchechi, twavelili tukukukushiwa kunu na kunu mubahali ya Adiliya, payifikili mandandu vagola chichuku va muwatu vakacheyi kucha vava pabehi ya pamulima. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vakadayileyi kumanya utali wa machi kwa kudubushila luwoyi luveli lukongiwa chindu chisitapili, vapata utali wa mawoku milongu mchechi, pambeli vapima kandi vapata mawoku milongu mitatu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwanongwa tutila ndula muupala, vadubushila myuma misitu mchechi kumbeli ya watu ili kupayika watu na vakadadaveyi kuchi kalopu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vagolafichuku va muwatu vakadayileyi kutuva, vasunushili kala watu mdokwa mumachi, vakayilyambishileyi kudanga findu fisitu mumachi pawulongolu ya watu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lakini Pauli kamuwombela yula mkomi wa machonda na machonda vaki, “Kucha vagolafichuku ava va watu pavasighala ng'odu mugati ya watu, damulowuliwi ha.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Topi vala machonda vasidumula ngoyi siveli sikamulila wula watu mdokwa, vawuleka utoliwi na machi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Linyagogolu, Pauli avakuvilishili vonda valyi filivi kadeta, “Kwa majuva lilongu na mchechi mwaveli mukuyipwelesha na kuleka kulya, mkali hela kulya chindu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Topi, nguvaluva mulyi filivi nongwa mukudayila kunana. Kwanongwa hata lufwili lumu lwa mitwi yenu daluyaghamili ha.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pauli pamalili kudeta nawula, katola libumunda, kamulumba Chapanga pawulongolu ya vosi, kametula, kakanda kulya. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Topi vonda vapata moyu na veni wuwu valya filivi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Twavelili vandu mya mbili na milongu saba na sita muwatu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kila mundu palili fivili vitangalili, vapungushili usitu muwatu vayasa fivelekwa mubahali.</para>
  <para style="s">Watu wudumuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kukachi, vagolafichuku va watu vaweshili ha kuumanya mlima wula, ila vawonili lisopu, vakayiholili pavawesha vakapayiki pala. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vadumula sila ng'oyi sivakongileyi myuma misitu ya kuwolushela watu vasileka mubahali, topi vatola midengi ya kusolela watu ili vayendi kula kulisopu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lakini pawufikili pachimelu watu wagwamili. Mbembi ya kuulongolu yayingilili mulilundu lya muhanga, yikatikanyikeyi ha. Mbembi ya kumbeli ya watu yikakandeyi kumetuka mbiliwa mbiliwa kwa kubotiwa na liwovi lya majinga makomi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Machonda vakadayileyi kuvawulagha vafungwa vonda, vakatileyi davasuvili mbaka kumlima na kutuva. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lakini yula mkomi wa machonda akadayileyi kumlowola Pauli, avakanishili vakotoo kugola nawula. Avalayishili vala vamanyili kusuvilila vajumbi kufuma muwatu na vasuvili mbaka kumwambu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Vamonga vavakovikeli pavayikamulila mimbalu awu mufipandi fya watu yimetukili. Nahawu ndi twawosi wutufikili kumlima vanofu.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yimupatili Pauli mumlima wa Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Patufikili kala kumlima, twamanyili lila liwunguli likukemiwa Malita. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Venikaya va pala vaveli vasangi munu kwa yufwi. Ndonya yaveli yikukanda kutonya na kwavaveli na lupepu, topi vakoshili motu, vatulibushila. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pauli asolili msiwu mdokwa wa ngilu avelili akusitaya pachikoshu, kwanongwa ya ukali wa motu wula, njoka afumili mungilu kamuluma Pauli muliwoku na kalemilela. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Venikaya vala pala pavawonili njoka paning'ina muliwoku lya Pauli vayiwombela, “Ndina hoshu kucha mundoyu aveli kawulaya mundu. Hata leki kalowoka mubahali, lugotu lwa vamlungu dayimuleki ng'odu ayendileli kunana.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pauli kamupundila njoka yula mumotu na agobukili hata padokwa ha. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vala vandu vavelili vakashuvilileyi kucha angamemili awu bahala pala angawili na kusova. Pavavetili kwa chipindi chitali padokwa ngajila kuwona Pauli kagoliwa na chindu ng'odu, vaghalambula hoshu shawu kwa mweni, vadeta kucha mweni ndi chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pabehi ya pala paveli na fitava fya mkomi wa liwunguli, litawa lyaki Pubiliu, mundoyu atulibushilili chilighanja, twaveli vahenja vaki kwa majuva matatu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Topi, tatimundu Pubiliu avelili kawonja pawulili, mtami, kana msusa na kupweka mwasi. Pauli ayingilili munyumba yaki, kadadava na kamuvikila mawoku vaki pambindi ya mtami, kamunanisha. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pachigolikili kala chindu chila, vatami vamonga yivavelili muliwunguli lila vayisa na vavagola vanani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Veni vatugayila fupu sitangalili na chipindi patukandili kandi mwanja, vapakishili findu fitudayilili muwatu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja kufuma Malita mbaka Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Payipitili myesi mitatu, twakandili kandi mwanja wetu muwatu wumu wa Alekisandilia wuvawukemaya, “Valongu mambila.” Watu wula wavelili upayikiwa muliwunguli lila chipindi chosi cha lupepu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kufuma kula twafikili mumbwani ya Silakusa, twayikalili apa kwa majuva matatu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kufuma kula Salakusa twashengitili mbaka tufika Legiu. Palipitili lijuva limu, liyegha lyakandili kupugha kufuma kuchanya na pavapitili majuva mavili twafikili kambi ya Potioli. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kula twatang'anikili na Vakilistu vayetu, vatuluvili tuyikali nawu majuva saba nawula ndi wutufikili Loma. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vakilistu va kula Loma pavapikanishili milandu yetu, vayisili kutuyanga kusoku lya Apiu na mahali pavapakema, “Kumibudi Mitatu,” ya kulila na kuwonja. Pauli pavawonili amulumbili Chapanga, kasakapuka.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli aku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Patuyingilili Loma, Pauli ajumishiwili kuyikala mweni weka yaki pamu na machonda yumu wa kumdima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pavapitili majuva matatu, Pauli avakemili vakomi va Vayawudi va mahali pala vatanganiki pamu, pavayikungashili, Pauli kavawombela, “Valongu vangu, nenga, ingava ndagolili ng'odu chindu cha wafu wala kulimba chishovi sha vavaha vetu, vang'opili muchijaka kula Yelusalemu na kuvikiwa mumawoku va vandu va Loma. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Valoma pavadashili kala na kuwona ndivahela mbatiwa yoyonda, vakadayileyi kunekishela. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini Vayawudi vamonga valimbili chindochi na nenga nuva milandu ayi yiyeghiwili kwa Mutwa wa Loma, ingava naveli na chindu ha cha kuvahigha vanamlima vayangu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Topi, kwanongwa ayi, nuva kutang'ana na kuywanga na yumwi, ng'opiwa mingongola ayi kwanongwa ya shuvililu lila lya Isilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Veni vamuwombela, “Yufwi tupata ha baluwa yoyonda yifumili Yudeya, wala kwahela mlongu yoyonda yafikili apa kuyegha chilongu cheni awu kudeta chochosi cha wafu chikwilatili yuwi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini tukuyihola yingavelili nyanyi tupikani kwa umweni filongu fivelili kumutwi yaku. Kwanongwa yufwi tumanya kucha chipinga achi chilimbiwa kosi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Topi, vapangili na mweni lijuva lya kutang'ana na vandu vatangalili nendu vamutyangila kunyumba yayikalagha, kukandila pamalavila mbaka palumihi avahimulili na kuvavikila lipala wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, akayesheyi kuvagola vajumili milandu ya Yesu kwa Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa na Mayandiku va Vambuyi va Chapanga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vandu vamonga vajumilili filongu fyaki, lakini vamonga vajumilili ng'odu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Topi, vaveli vavaghanika veni kwa veni. Pavaveghi vakuyenda, Pauli adetili chindu achi, “Nakaka fila Mfuki Mng'alili ndambu avawombilili vavaha venu kwa kupitila mbuyi wa Chapanga Isaya, <verse number="26" style="v"/>padeta, ‘Yendi kwa vandu ava ukavawombeli, kupikana damupikani, lakini damumanyi ha, kulola damuloli, lakini damuwoni ha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nongwa mahala va vandu ava vapufika,</para>
  <para style="q">vadiva majeji vawu,</para>
  <para style="q">vagunya mesu vawu.</para>
  <para style="q">Leki naha ng'odu, vangalolili kwa mesu vawu,</para>
  <para style="q">vangapikanishili kwa majeji vawu.</para>
  <para style="q">Vangamanyili kwa mahala vawu,</para>
  <para style="q">na kung'alambukila akudeta Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q">na nenga ningavalowulili.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pambeli Pauli kadeta, “Topi, mumanyi unjagila wa Chapanga wa kulowola wuyeghiwa kwa vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi. Veni davapikani!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Padetili kala afi, Vayawudi vawuka, pavalimbana munu veni kwa veni. Mayandiku ava vakuwoneka ha mufitabu fingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwa chipindi chonda cha myaka mivili ayikalili munyumba yapangili mweni na aveli akuvalibushila vosi yivafikili kumjambusha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Aveli akulandula wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na kuvawula nendu milandu ya Bambu Yesu Kilistu, ngajila kutila na kwahela mundu yamukanishili.</para>
</usx>
